MID_LGV_SQID_Makeup_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_Makeup_Esm_m01_001: The balm Leda shared with me soothes my skin and\nmakes it so smooth... It's SO good!
MID_LGV_SQID_Makeup_Esm_m01_002: Do all the women in this city use this stuff? Doesn't\nmatter! I can compete!
MID_LGV_SQID_Makeup_Esm_m01_003: I'll get some nice makeup, enhance my style, and\nbefore you know it, you'll fall head over heels!
MID_LGV_SQID_Makeup_Esm_m01_004: Where do I get some though? I wonder... Sweetie,\ndo you know?
MID_LGV_SQID_Makeup_Esm_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_Makeup_Esm_m02_001: You actually went and got some for me? Sweetie!\nI'm touched!
MID_LGV_SQID_Makeup_Esm_m02_002: The first step on my road to being a trendsetter... Or\nso I hope.
MID_LGV_SQID_Makeup_Esm_m02_003: More importantly, it's a gift from you, Sweetie. I'll\njust use a little bit at a time, so it lasts!
MID_LGV_SQID_HrihRequest_Hri_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_HrihRequest_Hri_m01_001: You! I'd been hoping to speak with a person of\nyour talents.
MID_LGV_SQID_HrihRequest_Hri_m01_002: It's awful—some good-for-nothing stole a keepsake\nfrom me, a reminder of my little sister.
MID_LGV_SQID_HrihRequest_Hri_m01_003: I would recover this item at any cost, but I'm\nprevented from doing so.
MID_LGV_SQID_HrihRequest_Hri_m01_004: I can't leave the city right now. Might I ask you to\nretrieve it in my stead?
MID_LGV_SQID_HrihRequest_Hri_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_HrihRequest_Hri_m02_001: You recovered it for me! I am in your debt.
MID_LGV_SQID_HrihRequest_Hri_m02_002: On my name, Creek, I swear that I will repay your\nkindness someday.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m01_001: It's horrible... Night after night, stores around here\nhave been getting damaged.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m01_002: At first I thought it was a wolf or the like. But now\nthey're saying it could be a monster?!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m01_003: Someone saw a huge being ransacking a store and\ndisappearing into an alley on the {Lowercase}City Streets{NormalCase}.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m01_004: Of course, I'm ill-equipped to face such a thing!\nWould you? You'll be rewarded!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m01_005: The monster comes out at night. Thank you for\nhandling it. I'll be cheering you on...from home...
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m01: <BLN>I could never face such a thing.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m02_001: Wh— Really?! You defeated it?!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m02_002: Now the shopkeepers can sell our wares in peace!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m02_003: You've got a backbone of steel, I tell you. And serious\nskills too!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m02_004: I owe you big time. Go ahead and take the reward\nyou've earned!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleStrangeness_B01_m02: <BLN>I owe you big time.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m01_001: Hey, you're signing up for the Heroic Games, right?\nThen... I'd like you to teach me how to fight!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m01_002: See, I want to take down some thieves that\nattacked my dad.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m01_004: Tons of people get attacked around here, but the\ntemples do nothing about it! So I will.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m01_003: Huh? You'll go after the thieves for me? Are you\nsure? I mean, you don't look THAT strong.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m01: <BLN>I'll take them down...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m02_001: Wait—you really took out the thieves?! Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m02_002: Wow, I really owe you one! And...I take back what I\nsaid about you seeming weak.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m02_003: As an apology, I'll tell everyone what you did for me\nand make sure you get a good reputation!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_FirstSubjugation_B01_m02: <BLN>You're amazing!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m03_001: Hey, um, are you OK? What happened?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_B01_m01_001: *sniffle* I was playing in Niraga Mine and {SetColor=Gold}dropped\nmy favorite hair clip{SetColor=Default} on my way out...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_B01_m01_002: But I saw thieves near there and now I'm too scared\nto go looking for it.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m04_001: You know what? Leave it to us!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m04_002: A-aren't you scared?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m04_003: {SetColor=Gold}Niraga Mine{SetColor=Default}, right? Wait right here—we won't\nbe long!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m05_001: *sniffle* I dropped a hair clip... It was really—\n*sniffle*—special to me.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m05_002: It's too dangerous for me to go looking... But I can't\ngive up on it.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_m05: <BLN>I'll be waiting for you to get back.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_B01_m02_001: We found your hair clip!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_B01_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_B01_m03_001: You did?! Oh! Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_FirstDelivery_B01_m03_002: You're amazing! I'll find you again the next time\nI'm in trouble!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m01_001: Hey there, youngsters! Tell me, have you ever been\nto the Magnus Plateau?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m01_002: If you haven't, do yourself a favor and visit someday.\nI'll tell ya, the sunsets there are a thing of beauty.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m01_003: At least, they were. Lately, wild animals have been\nrampaging there.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m01_004: You can't get up there at all with that going on.\nIf only someone would drive them away...
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m01: <BLN>I wonder if anybody would...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m02_001: You drove the animals off?! My, you kids are\nreally something!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m02_002: That's where my wife and I had our first date. *sigh*\nMemories... I'll be glad to see the sunset again.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SearchSunset_B01_m02: <BLN>Well done, children.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m01_001: Please! My granddaughter ran off to play, but\nhasn't been back in ages!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m01_002: If you find her, please send her back to me, will you?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m01_003: She's been obsessed with the Heroic Games, so I fear\nshe might be near the arena...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m01_004: I hear there are criminals all over the capital. I hate\nto think it...but what if she's been kidnapped?!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m01: <BLN>Somebody, please!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B02_m01_001: Hehehe! I got to shake hands with a gladiator!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B02_m01_002: He was so strong, and his hands were HUGE!\nHaha! The capital is so cool!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B02_m01: <BLN>I'm glad I came to the capital!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B02_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B02_m02_001: Huh? Kidnapped? Oh, Grandma...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B02_m02_002: I was captured, alright! My heart was captured\nby a big, strong gladiator. Hehehe!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B02_m02_003: Ahh, aw well. I guess it's time I head back to that\nboring old house, huh...
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B02_m02: <BLN>You're looking for me?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m02_001: My granddaughter is back safe thanks to you.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m02_002: Take my eyes off her and I know she'll just run off\nagain. She's a lot like me when I was younger.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m02_003: One day she'll understand what it's like to worry\nover someone... One day...
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SearchingGranddaughter_B01_m02: <BLN>Thank you...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m01_001: Excuse me! A moment? I have an important request\nfor you!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m01_002: There should be two other women with brooms\nsomewhere in Dagsion.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m01_003: If you find them, could you deliver a message?\nTell them, "The goal has been achieved."
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m01_004: If it helps, they shouldn't be in hightown or lowtown.\nThanks in advance!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m01: <BLN>Where did they go?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m02_001: You spoke to my sisters then? Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m02_002: See, I'm a bit of a clean freak. And the spectators for\nthe Heroic Games keep dirtying up the town!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m02_003: So I asked my sisters to help me clean up the place.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m02_004: But I got so caught up in cleaning that I let us all get\nseparated. I wasn't sure I'd ever find them.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m02_005: Then you came along! There really are nice folks\nout there, huh? That CLEANED my heart. Hehe!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B01_m02: <BLN>Kindness isn't dead, it seems.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B02_m01_001: Huh? A message for me? "The goal has\nbeen achieved."
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B02_m01_002: The way that's phrased... It must be from my older\nsister. Understood! Tell her I'm on my way home!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B02_m01: <BLN>Where did she go?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B02_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B02_m02_001: Oh my, did you need something? Oh, a message?\n"The goal has been achieved"? I see.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B02_m02_002: My apologies... It appears my sister has presumed\nupon you. But, yes. I understand. I'll be off then.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_Doppelganger_B02_m02: <BLN>I wonder where she went...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m01_001: Alexandra, Alexandra... How the very sight of you\nmakes my heart sing...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m01_002: Oh, hi there. Yeah, I'm smitten, alright. I know\nI was just another one of her fans...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m01_003: But then my heart erupted like a volcano! I can't\nkeep my feelings from gushing out!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m01_004: Please, deliver my love letter to her. This is\nthe dream of a lifetime!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m01_005: She's always with her {LowercaseNextLetter}Pegasus, so they stand out,\nwherever they might be. My fate is in your hands!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m01: <BLN>My Alexandra...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B02_m01_001: Hm? A letter for me? How thoughtful of you to\ndeliver it.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B02_m01_002: I get these kinds of letters all the time. But they\nalways seem to vanish after I read them once!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B02_m01_003: I wonder why... It's very strange. Do you happen\nto know why, Bucephalus?
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B02_m01: <BLN>What a good boy, Bucephalus!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m02_001: Alexandra got my letter? How perfect!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m02_002: I hope she feels the same as I do. How could she\nnot? Oh, I can't wait to hear from her!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SolitaryFlower_B01_m02: <BLN>So exciting!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m01_001: One of the cats we care for at our temple has\nrecently gone missing.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m01_002: I've looked everywhere—behind stairs, around\nthe plants, even in the temple kitchen.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m01_003: I fear that it's wandered down Temple Row and is\naround the {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena somewhere. Could you look?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m01_004: That little cutie is brown from ear to tail. Please\ndo let me know if you see it!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m01: <BLN>Not here either...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m02_001: I'm so glad you found the cat! I've been terribly\nworried since it went missing.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m02_002: What? That little cutie was near the fountain?\nThe poor thing must have been thirsty!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m02_003: I did find a bag of salt clawed open in the kitchen.\nHmm... I'll be sure to give the kitty a checkup!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B01_m02: <BLN>I'm so glad!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B02_m01_001: Hey, look! I think that's the brown cat they talked\nabout at the temple.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B02_m01_002: Hey, kitty! You ought to head on home. There's \npeople there who are worried about you.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B02_m01_003: Me...ow? Meow!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_LostCat_B02_m01: <BLN>Meow?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m01_001: Hey! Sorry, have you seen a well-dressed old man\naround here? He's my master, but he's missing!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m01_002: His memory isn't what it used to be, so I'm always\ntrying to keep an eye on him.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m01_003: If you find him, I'll give you a reward! Just please\nhelp me look for him.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m01_004: I don't think he'd leave Dagsion. I've already checked\nthe higher levels, so maybe he's in lowtown?
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m01: <BLN>Master! Master!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B02_m01_001: Huh... Why did I come here again?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B02_m01_002: Oh, right... My wife. She must have suggested I get\nsome fresh air by the water...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B02_m01_003: Yes, that must be it. She said it'd make me\nfeel better...didn't she?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B02_m01_004: Someone out there is worried about me, aren't they?\nMaybe I should head back for today...
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B02_m01: <BLN>Why am I...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m02_001: I'm so glad he's OK! And also relieved I'm not out\nof a job.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m02_002: But why was he in a place like that? Who knows\nwhat would have happened if he'd fallen in.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_SearchingNobleman_B01_m02: <BLN>That was close...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m01_001: There's this rumor I heard from a gladiator friend\nof mine...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m01_002: Apparently, there's been some evil guy locked up in\nthe arena's basement for hundreds of years.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m01_003: They say his gaze is so cold, even eye contact is\nenough to make your heart stop.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m01_004: Heh! Yeah, right! People like that don't really exist.\nIf you ever meet him, let me know, would ya?
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m01: <BLN>No way that's true!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m02_001: So he told you to tell me no one was there? Heh!\nSee! I knew there wasn't anybody down there.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m02_002: Wait a minute! Then who exactly told YOU to tell\nME... What are you hiding?!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m02_003: Know what?! Forget it! That's the last time I ask you\nfor anything! I'll go and find out for myself one day!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B01_m02: <BLN>I'll check it out myself!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B02_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B02_m01_001: Someone wants to visit, eh? Interesting. Bring him\nto me.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B02_m01_002: I'll grant his wish to see me...right before I strangle\nhim to death.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B02_m01_003: ...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B02_m01_004: Curiosity can be a deadly vice. Tell the man there\nwas no one here.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_DeepestSinner_B02_m02: <BLN>...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m01_001: Excuse me, but... You're a competitor in the Heroic\nGames, aren't you?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m01_002: I'm a big fan! No, silly, not of you...of Dietrich!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m01_003: I've watched him fighting and I couldn't tear my eyes\noff him!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m01_004: I wrote this poem for him. Could you deliver it?\nI'm too shy to give it to him myself!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m01_005: He is often found by Mars's temple. 
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m01: <BLN>How can I get this to him?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m02_001: You delivered my poem! I'm so glad that Dietrich\nwas pleased to receive it.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m02_002: You've emboldened me! I will deliver my own gifts\nfrom now on. Thank you.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_Courage_B01_m02: <BLN>You've emboldened me!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B02_m01_001: What is this scrap of paper? Do you mean for me to\ntake it?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_Courage_B02_m01_002: Poetry? It is beautifully composed. I do not know\nwhere it came from, but I thank you for it.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_Courage_B02_m01: <BLN>What is this?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m01_001: I make a living as a {LowercaseNextLetter}Carriage driver, but my carriage\njust stopped working.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m01_002: I was outrunning some thieves the other day and\ndrove so fast my axle cracked...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m01_003: I use the same high-end axles used on chariots.\nThe ones from Megaira in Saramis.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m01_004: Say... You wouldn't be able to get one for me, would\nyou? I'll reward you with... Oh, I know!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m01_005: By law, children can't use {LowercaseNextLetter}Carriages, but I could\nprobably get you special permission!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m01_006: But how would you even get to Megaira in the\nfirst place? Ah, forget it!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m01: <BLN>My business is ruined...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m02_001: This is it! Just the kind of axle I need! Did you really\ngo all the way to Megaira for this?!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m02_002: I underestimated you, boy... You might be small, but\nas capable as any adult, that's for sure.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m02_003: You'll need {LowercaseNextLetter}Carriage access. So, as promised, starting\ntoday, you'll have special permission to use them!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_UsedHarness_B01_m02: <BLN>Please use the {LowercaseNextLetter}Carriages!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m01_001: You tend to forget things as you get older. But I've\nbeen lucky to keep a few memories close.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m01_002: When I was a soldier, serving in the fort to the north,\nI would carve a wooden figure between missions.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m01_003: I knew I'd get scolded if my captain found it, so I hid\nit in a gap of stone within the wall around the fort.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m01_004: Before I die, I'd like to see it again... Could you see if\nit's still there?
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m01: <BLN>What happened to it?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m02_001: I can hardly believe my luck!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m02_002: I worshipped Jurah, you see. This statue made my\nwork easier to endure.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m02_003: Jurah may still be as beautiful as this statue.\nAs for me? Aha! Not so much.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_MemoriesTreasure_B01_m02: <BLN>I get to hold it again...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m01_001: My wife's birthday is coming up soon, and I'd like to\nget a bouquet of her favorite flowers.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m01_002: I used to grow them myself, but I don't really do that\nanymore. Now I have to go out and pick them.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m01_003: Hey, you seem pretty spry. Would you mind\ngathering some for me?
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m01: <BLN>I need lots of them...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B02_m01_001: That old man by the fountain keeps sighing.\nI wonder if he's worried about something.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B02_m01: <BLN>That old man...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m02_001: Oh, thank you! With these, I'll be able to put a\nbouquet on my dear wife's grave.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m02_002: I'd go on the anniversary of her death, but I can't\nbear the sadness. So I prefer to visit on her birthday.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m02_003: I wonder how many more birthdays I'll get to\ncelebrate. I can only hope for many more...
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_LargeBouquet_B01_m02: <BLN>Thank you...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m01_001: Pegasi truly are amazing, aren't they? Beautiful,\nmajestic, and can even fly.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m01_002: I came to the capital in hopes of getting one as a pet,\nbut it turns out they aren't sold here.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m01_003: Hey... You were in the {LowercaseNextLetter}Stable, right? So, you're like a\nservant or something? Perfect!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m01_004: Would you get a {Lowercase}Wild Pegasus{NormalCase} for me? I'll reward you\nif you do!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m01: <BLN>I want a pegasus!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m02_001: I knew pegasi were amazing. They're elegant,\ngraceful, and... *sigh* Not good with men...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m02_002: How was I supposed to know pegasi only accept\nfemale riders?!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m02_003: I guess I wouldn't want some guy climbing on my\nback either. Well, maybe we can still be friends.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_LikePegasus_B01_m02: <BLN>I should have known...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m01_001: Mom says everybody has things they like, and things\nthey don't like.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m01_002: Me? I like eating fish! What I don't like is\nTOUCHING fish with my hands.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m01_003: My mom gets as grossed out by touching fish as I do.\nShe's sick and stuck in bed right now...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m01_004: I wanna make her favorite food, but I'm not touching\nany fish! So, um, can you go fishing for me?
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m01: <BLN>I need fish...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m02_001: You caught fresh fish?! Wow! This is gonna help\nme make Mom feel better for sure!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m02_002: How do I cook fish if I can't stand touching them?\nEasy. I don't! I gulp 'em down raw, head and all!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m02_003: Nah, what I really do is wrap it in noodle dough with\nherbs then steam it. It's tasty!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_BigAndSmall_B01_m02: <BLN>Thanks for the fish!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m01_001: I want to go to Castalia, but there's some nasty\npeople blocking the road at Hugo Stronghold.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m01_002: They're definitely not official border guards! I have\na travel pass, and they wouldn't even look at it!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m01_003: I suppose I could've taught them a lesson, but I'm\ntoo nice, so I just turned around and came back.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m01_004: I do need to get through there... I wish someone\nwould chase those people away.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m01: <BLN>I need to get through...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m02_001: They were a band of thieves? What a bunch of\nno-good jerks!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m02_002: But they lost in a fight to a kid... Maybe I wouldn't\nhave needed to fight too hard after all.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m02_003: Anyway, thanks for your help. I'm off to Castalia.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_AdultSituation_B01_m02: <BLN>They weren't so tough after all!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m01_001: I'm looking for someone "reliable" to help me.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m01_002: I'm here from Idyia on business, and need to head\nhome, but I hear there's wild beasts on the road.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m01_003: If I pass through there, they'll eat all the food I'm\nhauling, and probably me too!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m01_004: Anyway, a girl told me there was a "reliable" person\naround here, and it looks like I've finally met him.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m01_005: You can drive those beasts away, can't you? I'm so\nworried about this whole situation!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m01: <BLN>Hey, kid...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m02_001: You cleared out the beasts? Thank you! I can finally\nhead home.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m02_002: Is it true that you're from Ribeira? Well, you might\nalready know this about the Idyia region...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m02_003: but there's a place I think you'll find interesting\njust east of Libertas Stronghold.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_NoEntry_B01_m02: <BLN>Come and visit sometime!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m01_001: We've got a massive infestation of {LowercaseNextLetter}Sandbaels on the\nKlytius plains! People are going to die!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m01_002: I was ordered to go exterminate them, but...\nI'm so scared of insects!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m01_003: Do you like creepy giant bugs? I bet you do. Could\nyou take care of those {LowercaseNextLetter}Sandbaels for me?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m01_004: Once they're dead, just collect the {Lowercase}Sandbael Tails{NormalCase} and\ncome on back. It's that easy!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m01: <BLN>This is a big problem!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m02_001: You did it?! You exterminated the {LowercaseNextLetter}Sandbaels! You\nreally don't mind dealing with bugs, do you?!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m02_002: I'm sorry, I know you like creepy giant bugs, and I\nfeel really guilty I asked you to kill them.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m02_003: But you saved so many lives! Probably mine too!\nPlease, let me say thank-you.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_BattlePest_B01_m02: <BLN>Let me thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m01_001: Have you ever heard of the "{Lowercase}Forsaken Lakehouse{NormalCase}"?\nIt's just south of Lake Baal.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m01_002: It's been abandoned for years and years, but the \nowner has decided to put it up for auction.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m01_003: It's a magnificent structure, built by a master of the\ncraft. Its listing has caused quite a stir on the market.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m01_004: However, it is also a den for wild beasts, and that is\nputting a damper on everyone's excitement.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m01_005: If you'd like a reward, the current owner would like\nthe wild beasts removed from his property.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m01: <BLN>They must be exterminated...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m02_001: You exterminated all the wild beasts at the \n{Lowercase}Forsaken Lakehouse{NormalCase}? Goodness! Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m02_002: You've earned your reward! And, I suppose, it's time\nto admit that I'm the one who owns the place.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m02_003: I used to keep beasts there, but I forgot to lock the\ncage one day and...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m02_004: Well, I haven't been able to get close in a long time.\nBut thanks to you, I can again!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m02_005: I'm looking forward to the auction. The place is\nrun down, but I know it will sell for a lot. Thanks!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_DreamHome_B01_m02: <BLN>I'm looking forward to the auction...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m01_001: You know those birds, the big ones that can run fast\nand jump over walls? That's an {LowercaseNextLetter}Ornius!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m01_002: I really need to get hold of two {LowercaseNextLetter}Orniuses.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m01_003: Think you can catch me a pair? I'll give you a\nreward if you do!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m01: <BLN>I really need those birds...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m02_001: You found the birds for me! Thank you! Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m02_002: My girlfriend's dad doesn't want us getting married,\nso he's locked her up inside their mansion!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m02_003: But I'll never give up on our love! I'm riding these\n{LowercaseNextLetter}Orniuses to rescue her so we can elope!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_OrniuGroup_B01_m02: <BLN>I just need {LowercaseNextLetter}Orniuses!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m01_001: I've got some real trouble here. I need lots of\nvegetables. Like, LOTS of vegetables.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m01_002: The ship that was supposed to make a delivery to \nthe Saramis guesthouse hit a rock and sank...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m01_003: I hear folks from Saramis can be pretty brutal... Oh, I\nbet I'm in for a beating. Help me out here!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m01: <BLN>Help me!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m02_001: You picked some vegetables for me? That's great!\nYa know, I think this'll be enough!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m02_002: I got worried and came clean with the Saraminians.\nCan you believe they said not to worry?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m02_003: I shouldn't believe nasty stories about people. Only\nthing I can trust in this town is good kids like you.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables1_B01_m02: <BLN>Thank you so much!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m01_001: Wow, you smell sorta like... Is that fertilizer? Whew!\nSay, are you a farmer's kid?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m01_002: There's a dinner party at the Arago guesthouse, and\nI'm supposed to supply good-looking vegetables.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m01_003: But my order was in a cart that ran off the road and\naaaaaall the vegetables got squished up!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m01_004: You smell like your parents would know how to get\nme a large amount of vegetables, quick.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m01: <BLN>What is that smell?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m02_001: Thank you! These vegetables are all so beautiful\nand fresh!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m02_002: I've heard scary things about that Arago king. I bet\nI'd have been killed if the party was canceled!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m02_003: Haha, I was just about ready to write my will!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables2_B01_m02: <BLN>Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m01_001: Hey, kid. You heard about the prison cells and\ngladiator training spaces under the arena?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m01_002: Gabriel, the guy who takes care of the place, said\nthey've got a rat problem.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m01_003: The rats are getting at the fresh veggies I delivered.\nRat poop everywhere! Somebody's gonna get sick!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m01_004: I'd like to get some new stock for him real quick.\nYou got anything on hand?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m01_005: You look like a kid good at field work. If I'm wrong,\nI'll look elsewhere. If not, maybe you can help.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m01: <BLN>I need some fresh stock, now!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m02_001: Look at that! Big, ripe, delicious vegetables! Great\njob getting these together.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m02_002: Your parents must really appreciate all your help in\nthe fields. Huh? Your parents are locked up?!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m02_003: Ha! That's a good joke! I almost believed you. I'm off\nto deliver these while they're still fresh. Thanks!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_OrderVegetables3_B01_m02: <BLN>I'll deliver these while they're fresh.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m01_001: Not sure how much help a child will be, but you're\nbetter than nothing.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m01_002: Somebody needs to do something about the thieves\non the Bran plains in Idyia.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m01_003: But they're no pushovers, that's for sure. In fact,\nthey've killed everyone else who's confronted them.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m01_004: Hey... Maybe they'll lower their guard if they're up\nagainst children. Please... I'm running out of options.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m01: <BLN>They're a tough bunch...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m02_001: What?! You beat the thieves?! You're kidding, right?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m02_002: That's incredible! Who are you?! Huh,\n"Ribeira Winds..."
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m02_003: Oh! You're the clan from the games everyone is\ntalking about! Wow, I'm sorry I doubted you...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m02_004: Hey, um... Can I shake your hand? It's not every day\nyou meet the future winner of the Heroic Games.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_AnnoyingResident_B01_m02: <BLN>I feel bad, but...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m01_001: Ever heard of a place called the Mulciber Marshlands\nin the Melias region?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m01_002: It's the site of an ancient battle that took many lives.\nRisen dead there are known to attack travelers.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m01_003: But it seems like the amount of risen dead has\nincreased a lot recently.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m01_004: They must be harboring a deep grudge against our\nworld. I hope someone can put those souls to rest...
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m01: <BLN>The risen dead are hurting people...
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m02_001: You've given those restless souls peace, even if only\nfor a short time.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m02_002: Now travelers can pass there safely. Thank you for\nyour hard work.
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_DeadPeace_B01_m02: <BLN>Thank you for all you've done.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m01_001: Hey, have you ever been to Headsman's Rock? Used\nto be a place for criminal executions.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m01_002: Now the place just gives me the creeps! Soldiers\npassing by claim to see a huge, wriggling shadow.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m01_003: Word is, it's a spirit of the dead or some underworld\nmessenger!
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m01_004: Can't say if it's true or not—the place is too far away\nfor me to go. But I do wonder...
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m01: <BLN>Could it really be true?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m02_001: Whoa, that's incredible! So it was a wandering\n{LowercaseNextLetter}Necrodragon all along, huh?
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m02_002: That place is cursed with the remnants of its horrific\npast. Maybe that's what attracted such a creature.
MID_LGV_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m02_003: Now I'm even more curious about what other\nmonsters are out there!
MID_LGA_SQID_KAI_DragonValley_B01_m02: <BLN>Incredible!
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge_Common_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge_Common_m01_001: You issued the duel challenge, yes? I am here to\nanswer it.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge1_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge1_m01_001: Yesss... I am Borges, the Bloodsucker! Black-clad\nkiller, I will feast upon your blood!
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge1_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge1_m02_001: Your technique was fascinating to behold. Perhaps I\nshall try it myself.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge2_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge2_m01_001: I am Aguirre, known as Hawk-Killer! Your body will\nsoon well know my lethal skill!
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge2_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge2_m02_001: A combat art suited to flying foes... Intriguing. I may\nsoon give it a try.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge3_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge3_m01_001: You may call me Sepente, the Amphisbaena. I am\ngrateful you accepted my challenge.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge3_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge3_m02_001: A combat art of avoidance and follow-up attacks...\nQuite useful to counter foes. It is worth a try!
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge4_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge4_m01_001: I am Camilo, known to all as the Giant-Hunter! Now,\nto battle, brave warrior! Let us live strong this day!
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge4_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge4_m02_001: A means especially to attack large foes? What fun.\nI can see the use of it.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge5_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge5_m01_001: I'm Il-Lara, the Piercer! You don't scare me!
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge5_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge5_m02_001: A useful technique for throwing a spear. If ever I\nwield one, I ought to keep it in mind.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge6_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge6_m01_001: My name is Cabaye, the Slashing Blur. I will prove to\nyou the superiority of cavalry!
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge6_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge6_m02_001: A technique that anticipates an opponent using\nDeadly Blade. Useful!
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge7_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge7_m01_001: They call me Sky-Shot, but my name is Damien. My\npiercing shots never miss.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge7_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge7_m02_001: A shot targeted from great distance. Simple\nand beautiful. I will not forget this.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge8_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge8_m01_001: My name is Berenguela, the Holy Fist! The purity of\nmy will shall set you upon the correct path.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge8_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge8_m02_001: A holy brawler? A rare technique. It could be useful.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge9_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge9_m01_001: I am Oko, called Devastator. My sword has been\nhoned to slay the gods over many years.
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge9_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DIT_Challenge9_m02_001: A sword technique perfected for fatal strikes! Truly\nmagnificent. I must attempt it.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Yaman_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Yaman_m01_001: Are you the dancer they asked to perform?\nWell, we're all ready. Please begin!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Yaman_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Yaman_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a passionate dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Yaman_m02_002: Wonderful! Invigorating! The festival has been a\nhuge success. Thank you.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m01_001: The citizen militia is waiting for you. Please, dance\nfor everyone!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m01_002: Leda. You've come back to us? How joyous!\nWould you cheer us all up with a dance?
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m01_003: You're here to cheer us all up? After all you did to\nhelp us rebuild. Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a dance in recognition of their service.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m02_002: That was even more beautiful than I'd expected.\nI'll pay you as much as you want!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m02_003: <TLP>Leda performed an uplifting dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m02_004: Ohhh. As ever, your dancing is so lovely. Now I feel\ninspired to face the risen dead!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m02_005: <TLP>Leda performed an uplifting dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Legia_m02_006: Thank you. That was absolutely wonderful. Now I\nfeel inspired to face the risen dead!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Demonic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Demonic_m01_001: Thank you for coming—the banquet's about to begin.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Demonic_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Demonic_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a wholehearted dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Demonic_m02_002: Oh, thank you. You've made this an absolutely\nunforgettable event.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Carianeira_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Carianeira_m01_001: With your arrival, all the performers are here!\nLet's start the launch ceremony.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Carianeira_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Carianeira_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a heroic dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Carianeira_m02_002: Gahaha! The launch ceremony went excellently.\nI knew I picked the right performer!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_IoPort_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_IoPort_m01_001: You must be the dancer everyone's talking about.\nI know you just got here, but do you mind?
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_IoPort_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_IoPort_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed an elegant dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_IoPort_m02_002: Wonderful—beautiful. I was completely lost in the\nperformance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m01_001: We've been waiting for you! There's an important\nclient in the audience... Please try not to offend him!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m01_002: Leda—you performed here before, right? I'm flattered\nyou would visit our little hamlet again.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m01_003: You're going to dance for us? I'm flattered you came\nto visit our little hamlet.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a beautiful dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m02_002: The client had a surly look on his face—but that's\nwhat he looks like when he's happy. Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m02_003: <TLP>Leda performed a soothing dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m02_004: Thanks to you, now I have the energy to wait for\nthe missing villagers to come back.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m02_005: <TLP>Leda performed a soothing dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Zasta_m02_006: Thanks to you, now I have the energy to wait for\nthe missing villagers to come back.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m01_001: Welcome to Mons. This is the banquet hall where\nyou'll be performing. Please and thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m01_002: L-Leda?! You're alive! And came to dance for us?\nBy all means!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m01_003: You came here to dance for all of us? I couldn't ask\nfor anything more—please and thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed an appreciative dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m02_002: Ah, it's as though I've been cleansed in mind and\nbody. I feel lucky just to have seen it!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m02_003: <TLP>Leda performed an emboldening dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m02_004: That was wonderful! It makes me so glad to be alive.\nI'll survive to see you dance again, Leda!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m02_005: <TLP>Leda performed an emboldening dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Mons_m02_006: That was wonderful! It makes me so glad to be alive.\nI'll survive to see you dance again!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Alecto_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Alecto_m01_001: Heeeey, missy... *hic* Ya fin'lly made it! *hic* Give us\na jig to dance 'n drink to!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Alecto_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Alecto_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed an exhilarating dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Alecto_m02_002: That was GREAT! Boy, I feel—*hic*—drunk... Drunk\noff yer dancin'!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Basque_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Basque_m01_001: Hey, you look kinda familiar. Well, anyway. Go on\nand get on that stage!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Basque_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Basque_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed an invigorating dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Basque_m02_002: The crowd's going wild! Everyone's excited and\nopening their wallets. I love it!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Orens_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Orens_m01_001: Welcome to Orens, and thanks for coming!\nIt's not much to look at...but you can make it bloom.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Orens_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Orens_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a flashy dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Orens_m02_002: Amazing... You've made this ash-filled town glow\nlike a rainbow. You're a true dancer!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m01_001: I want the soothing winds of art to blow through\nthis town. Please, give us a dance!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m01_002: You came back to perform? I could almost cry, I'm so\nhappy... Please share your talents with the survivors!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m01_003: This was once a thriving port town, but now... *sigh*\nPlease share your talents with the survivors.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed an artful dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m02_002: That wasn't just wind... That was a STORM! How\nincredible. Please come again!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m02_003: <TLP>Leda performed an energizing dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m02_004: You made even the most despairing people start to\ndance. Hope has sprung up in their hearts.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m02_005: <TLP>Leda performed an energizing dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Pandora_m02_006: You made even the most despairing people start to\ndance. Hope has sprung up in their hearts.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m01_001: Welcome! Everyone's eager to see you dance.\nCome, let's start the banquet!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m01_002: Leda?! I was here last time you danced! Please,\nbring inspiration to everyone's hearts.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m01_003: The folks who used to live here are slowly but surely\nreturning. Please, inspire everyone with your dance!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a fun banquet dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m02_002: My, my! That was wonderful. Please, come back to\nvisit us again!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m02_003: <TLP>Leda performed an energizing dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m02_004: Thank you. There may be fewer of us, but I can see\nthat everyone's a little happier.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m02_005: <TLP>Leda performed an energizing dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Maon_m02_006: It's been a long time since I've seen everyone this\nhappy! Thanks. The town owes you a debt.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Tobalin_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Tobalin_m01_001: This is a very noble thing you're doing. Come now,\ngive us a beautiful performance!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Tobalin_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Tobalin_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed an elegant dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Tobalin_m02_002: Ohoho! You look just like I did in my younger days.\nCome perform for us again!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m01_001: There you are. Well, the stage is inside the arena.\nBy all means, dance for everyone!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m01_002: Leda?! Forgive my shock, but I just can't believe\nyou're alive! Would you perform in the arena?
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m01_003: You want to dance as a way to soothe us all? We've\nturned the arena into a shelter. Please, go ahead!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a calming dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m02_002: You are like a rose blooming in a wasteland.\nBeautiful, indomitable, and thorny!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m02_003: <TLP>Leda performed a brave warrior's dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m02_004: How many years have passed since the arena shook\nwith such strong applause? You've fueled our victory!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m02_005: <TLP>Leda performed a brave warrior's dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Breston_m02_006: How many years have passed since the arena shook\nwith such strong applause? You've fueled our victory!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Willy_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Willy_m01_001: I know this is unusual, but I'd like you to dance to\nhonor the spirits at this memorial. Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Willy_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Willy_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a dance to honor the dead.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Willy_m02_002: Is it my imagination, or is the air lighter somehow?\nI'm so glad I invited you to perform!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Osiris_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Osiris_m01_001: The fortune teller says that if you dance for us, water\nwill come back to the dried-up well. Please try!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Osiris_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Osiris_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed an emotional dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Osiris_m02_002: The water—it's springing up! It actually worked.\nYour dance caused a miracle!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Niza_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Niza_m01_001: Are you that dancer from the capital? My trading\npartner is from Brigid. Please perform accordingly!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Niza_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Niza_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a dance for the spirits.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Niza_m02_002: That was some real hospitality. My trading partner's\nthrilled. Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Aguinho_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Aguinho_m01_001: Thank you for coming. Please bless the pilgrims\nwith a dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Aguinho_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Aguinho_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a blessing dance.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Aguinho_m02_002: Would you look at all these faces? Thank you,\ndancer. Truly.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Benetnash_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Benetnash_m01_001: Hello! Would you dance upon the hill for us, to\nplease the god of the sea?
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Benetnash_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Benetnash_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a dance to honor the god.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Benetnash_m02_002: How lovely! I'm sure the god will be overjoyed.\nThank you, thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Byna_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Byna_m01_001: This oasis used to be a place of rest. Would you\nperform a dance so that it will be so again?
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Byna_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Byna_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a dance for restoration.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_Byna_m02_002: Ah, thank you! The late chief, my mother, is surely\nsmiling down on this.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_GranAragon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_GranAragon_m01_001: It'd be easier if we could give up hope...but we\nmustn't. Please, dance for us, and soften our pain.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_GranAragon_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_GranAragon_m02_001: <TLP>Leda performed a dance for peace.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_ShowXXX_GranAragon_m02_002: Thank you. Living is hard, but we'll keep on living in\nhopes that happiness awaits...
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m02_001: Well met. I am Vallejo Espada, a patron of the tavern\nyou frequent.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m02_002: I've long since retired, but I once made quite the\nname for myself in the theater as a dancer.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m02_003: No doubt there are many who still fondly recall\nthe name of Vallejo, the Pride of Midea!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m02_004: When I witnessed your dance at the tavern the\nother day, a realization struck me like lightning!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m02_005: That is, my realization that you are destined to be\nmy artistic successor!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m01_001: As long as I get the temples to recognize you as such,\nyou will obtain the {SetColor=Gold}dancer {SetColor=Default}certification.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m01_002: I've heard of that...
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m01_003: The {SetColor=Gold}dancer {SetColor=Default}certification is available only to a small\ngroup of dancers, not the general public.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m01_004: Yes. But to obtain it, you need the dancer's necklace,\nwhich I once received from my mentor.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m01_005: I wore it during my last performance...but then was\nattacked by bandits. It was damaged.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m01_006: I'd give it to you now if I could, but I don't have the\nmaterials for a repair.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m01_007: If you want to become a certified {SetColor=Gold}dancer{SetColor=Default}, you'll have\nto {SetColor=Gold}bring me{SetColor=Default} the {SetColor=Gold}materials{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGA_SQID_LED_Dancer_m01: <BLN>I want you to succeed me.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m03_001: I see. You'll find I'm rather stubborn—I do want you\nto be my successor.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m03_002: You can find me at the tavern if you'd like to speak\nabout it again.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m04_001: Excellent, thank you! I'll be at the tavern. Come\nspeak to me when you have the materials.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m04_002: I look forward to the day I can give you the necklace.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m05_001: Did you get the materials? I knew my chosen\nsuccessor would be able to!
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m05_002: Alright, that's the repairs finished. Now, here's the\ndancer's necklace.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m05_003: Give this to an exam proctor and you can earn your\n{LowercaseNextLetter}Dancer certification.
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m05_004: Ah, the joy I feel, having found my successor! Is this\nhow my mentor felt too?
MID_LGV_SQID_LED_Dancer_m05_005: Ahaha. I'm glad too. Maybe I'll head over soon and\nget my certification.
MID_LGV_SQID_NegotiationLourdija_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_NegotiationLourdija_B01_m01_001: You know, if you sail east of here, you'll find a place\ncalled the Saint Merida Islands.
MID_LGV_SQID_NegotiationLourdija_B01_m01_002: It used to be an old pirate hideout, but Vandahl\nTrading's turned it into a new branch of business!
MID_LGV_SQID_NegotiationLourdija_B01_m01_003: I've been getting all kinds of work transporting goods\nback and forth, and it's really starting to pay off!
MID_LGV_SQID_NegotiationLourdija_B01_m01_004: Hm? You wanna work for Vandahl Trading too?\nI guess I could tell you a bit more about the branch...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m01_001: Hey, do I look OK to you? I've been so stressed\nlately, and I'm hoping it's not too obvious.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m01_002: Thieves have made camp at the Granada Fort Ruins,\nand I can't pass them...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m01_003: I have to get this medicine to my mom back home.\nGods, please send someone to get rid of them!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m01: <BLN>Hold on, Mom...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m02_001: Y-you cleared out the thieves? Thank you! Seriously,\nthis bandit problem is getting out of hand.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m02_002: I think if you have power and numbers, you should\nuse that to help people, not hurt them...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m02_003: The world could use a few more like you. Here, take\nthis as a thank-you from me and my mother.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleGranada_B01_m02: <BLN>Thanks a lot!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m01_001: Hey, have you heard? There's a pack of ferocious\nwolves in the Valeri Gorge, southeast of the capital.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m01_002: We didn't think they were an issue, but the locals are\nscared... They're calling them the "Eight Fangs."
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m01_003: Attacks seem to be on the rise. If you've got strength,\nmaybe now would be the time to use it!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m01: <BLN>What troublesome beasts...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m02_001: Did you get rid of those troublesome mutts? I'm so\nglad I asked for your help.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m02_002: We wanted to back you up, but the Heroic Games\nhave the capital's security spread thin.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m02_003: Even so, with you around, the city is in good hands.\nIf we need help again, we know who to ask!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleValeri_B01_m02: <BLN>Thanks for the help!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m01_001: Have you ever heard of the Behelda Axes? They're a\ngroup of well-known thugs. 
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m01_002: They like to hide, then ambush their targets. They've\nalready raided several of our company's wagons!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m01_003: But enough is enough! You look strong, so...can I ask\nfor your help? Please, end every last one of them!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m01: <BLN>They got us again!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m02_001: I said "end them" out of anger for what they did to\nmy friends, but...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m02_002: I gotta say, I didn't think you'd take it so literally.\nI thought you'd just injure them or shoo them away.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m02_003: Well... Good job, anyway. Remind me not to get on\nyour bad side...
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleNapier_B01_m02: <BLN>Well done!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m01_001: Farmers near Sunset Fortress say their livestock's\nbeen disappearing.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m01_002: I found out it's a group of spellcasters that call\nthemselves Sithya's Secret Seal behind it.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m01_003: They believe ritual sacrifices increase their magic\npower...and I believe that sounds like trouble.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m01_004: I expect they're more of a danger to the animals than\nto people, but I'd still like to see them run off.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m01: <BLN>Sounds like trouble...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m02_001: I heard you ran them off. Well done. I've also heard\nsome disturbing things from the farmers.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m02_002: They found something terrible out in their fields...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m02_003: A hill-sized pile of animal bones. Skulls, rib cages,\nall the bits. More than they could count.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m02_004: So destructive to think sacrifice makes magic strong.\nIt's great you ran those fools off so quickly.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleMidea_B01_m02: <BLN>Thanks for your help.
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m01_001: Hey, if you got spare {Lowercase}Smithing Stone{NormalCase}s, could you\nshare 'em with me?
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m01_002: They're stones you can use to refine or repair your\nweapons! And they're kinda hard to come by lately.
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m01_003: I'm a mercenary, so I need to keep my weapons in\ngood shape, or I'll be useless.
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m01_004: I guess I oughta go to Niraga Mine and dig up some\n{Lowercase}Smithing Stone{NormalCase}s?
MID_LGA_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m01: <BLN>I'm a mercenary, not a miner...
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m02_001: You've got {Lowercase}Smithing Stones{NormalCase} to spare? Thanks!\nGuess I don't have to become a miner after all.
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m02_002: The Heroic Games have everybody snatching up all\nthe {Lowercase}Smithing Stone{NormalCase}s.
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m02_003: Seems like every fighter in Dagda is refining their\nweapons, thinking it'll give 'em a chance of winning.
MID_LGV_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m02_004: Are you going to enter too? Good luck! Just kidding.\nI'm gonna win the whole thing! Haha!
MID_LGA_SQID_StoneOrder_B01_m02: <BLN>Must be the Heroic Games...
MID_LGV_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m01_001: The gladiator I came to see will be up soon!
MID_LGV_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m01_002: When he comes out, I want to throw petals from his\nfavorite flower!
MID_LGV_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m01_003: Word is, he's a big fan of {LowercaseNextLetter}Yaamanthemums! If you\nfind any, would you mind sharing one with me?
MID_LGA_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m01: <BLN>It's almost time!
MID_LGV_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m02_001: So this is a {LowercaseNextLetter}Yaamanthemum? It's beautiful... I can\nsee why he likes it so much!
MID_LGV_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m02_002: He'll definitely notice it, right? Ha! Maybe he'll even\nlook at me!
MID_LGV_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m02_003: This is amazing, thank you!
MID_LGA_SQID_YamanOrder_B01_m02: <BLN>I'm so excited!
MID_LGV_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m01_001: Say... You wouldn't happen to have any {LowercaseNextLetter}Enrietto nuts\non you by chance?
MID_LGV_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m01_002: They're said to offer incredible boosts in energy. My\nmaster has a particular fondness for them.
MID_LGV_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m01_003: I'm in a bit of a rush, but it would help a lot if you\ncould get some for me.
MID_LGV_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m01_004: They're rumored to grow in the Sunlit Garden.\nPlease, hurry if you can.
MID_LGA_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m01: <BLN>I've got to hurry...
MID_LGV_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m02_001: Exactly what I asked for. Thank you on behalf of\nmy master!
MID_LGV_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m02_002: Hm? You want to know what my master will use\nthese for? Well, it's a bit of a personal matter...
MID_LGV_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m02_003: See, his son isn't feeling himself. My master hopes\nthat these will cheer him up. I suppose we'll see...
MID_LGA_SQID_EnrietteOrder_B01_m02: <BLN>My utmost thanks.
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m01_001: There are ruins across Dagda that were once thriving\nvillages, until their crops were lost to disease.
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m01_002: The Ruins of Megrez is one of those lost villages.
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m01_003: It's been long enough, it might be wise to check the\nsoil to see if the area is habitable by humans again.
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m01_004: If you find yourself near there, do you think you\ncould bring back a soil sample for me?
MID_LGA_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m01: <BLN>I could examine the soil...
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m02_001: Thank you for your help! I'll send the sample for\ntesting right away.
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m02_002: But I'm almost certain just from the look and the\nsmell that the contamination has disappeared. 
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m02_003: I didn't mention it before, but I was born in Megrez.\nThanks to you, I'll be able to return home soon.
MID_LGA_SQID_SearchingMegrez_B01_m02: <BLN>Thank you for your help!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m01_001: Have you heard of Bugs' Burrow? If you're hunting\nthe {Lowercase}Blight Louse{NormalCase}, that's the place.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m01_002: One of those things isn't terribly scary, but it's a bad\ntime once they start to swarm. 
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m01_003: I'd like to send an extermination team. But I'm all\nout of volunteers. I'd take help from anyone.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m01: <BLN>I need volunteers...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m02_001: You took care of the blight-louse problem by\nyourselves?! You must be totally fearless.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m02_002: That area used to draw hunters looking to bag a\n{Lowercase}Blight Louse{NormalCase}. But the lice started fighting back.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m02_003: Once they started feeding on dead hunters, they got a\ntaste for human flesh...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m02_004: Well, we don't have to worry about that anymore.\nHere, take this. I want to reward you for your work!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleHole_B01_m02: <BLN>You fearless warriors!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m01_001: Fallen General's Barrows is an unholy land, overrun\nby the dead. Have you ever visited it yourself?
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m01_002: Temple soldiers were sent to investigate monster\nsightings in the area, but none have returned.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m01_003: If you look into the situation, and eliminate any\ntrouble you find, I will compensate you well.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m01: <BLN>None have returned...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m02_001: A {LowercaseNextLetter}Necrodragon? Interesting...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m02_002: It's our own fault for abandoning that place, but it's\nstill stunning that it could become so tainted.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m02_003: I'll find a priest to cleanse the area and we can try\nagain. Thank you for the help. Here's your reward.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleMound_B01_m02: <BLN>That's what that was...
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m01_001: Adventurer... You've been traveling all over Dagda,\nhaven't you?
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m01_002: I'm searching for a sword of some renown. Perhaps\nyou've heard of killing edges?
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m01_003: If you should happen upon one in your travels, would\nyou consider delivering it to me?
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m01_004: I hear they can be found in Regia. With one in hand,\nperhaps I'll prevail in the battle that awaits me.
MID_LGA_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m01: <BLN>I need that blade...
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m02_001: You've procured a killing edge! Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m02_002: This sword...the brilliance of its blade. Magnificent.
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m02_003: But I hear my opponent has obtained the same blade\nas well...
MID_LGV_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m02_004: Then it will be a battle of skill that decides this\nmatch. Well, I suppose that's all part of the fun.
MID_LGA_SQID_LegiaShopping_B01_m02: <BLN>This will be fun!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m01_001: Where have I seen you before? Oh, right! You're\nin the Heroic Games, aren't you?!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m01_002: I watched your recent fight. Although "fight" is too\nbig a word. You are sloppy! Amateurs at best!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m01_003: I am leader of the Unerring Blades. Our legend\nresounds across all of Dagda!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m01_004: Prove your worth and fight us! If you lose, we take\nyour spot in the games, and you leave Dagsion!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m01_005: We will await you at Sonai Pass. Come face us if\nyou are not a coward!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m01: <BLN>I've seen your face before...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m02_001: W-we are defeated?! Looks like you have some skill\nafter all.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m02_002: Just so you know, I had planned to let you off easy if\nyou surrendered your spot in the Heroic Games. 
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDuel_B01_m02_003: But do not think this is the last you'll see of us!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m01_001: There's a pair of huge, hairy beasts lurkin' around\nMoonwatch Pass!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m01_002: They've been attacking anyone who even tries to\nget close! One even hurt my friends...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m01_003: If you're strong, then please, take those monsters out\nand avenge their victims!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m01: <BLN>We need revenge!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m02_001: So those things are called {Lowercase}Atlas Bear{NormalCase}s? Maybe they\nwere just hungry...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m02_002: But we merchants are strugglin' to survive every day\ntoo. No hard feelings, but I'm glad they're gone.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m02_003: Thank you for avenging my friends! It's not much,\nbut please take this as a reward.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleSunPass_B01_m02: <BLN>Thanks so much!
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m01_001: The capital really is an amazing place! It's filled with\nso many ingredients and dishes.
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m01_002: But I miss a certain flavor...
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m01_003: Something with a pungent aroma and a slightly bitter\ntaste, and it goes well with almost anything...
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m01_004: That's right! I'm talking about the flavor of {LowercaseNextLetter}Jyoppa, a\nfruit that is a specialty of my hometown!
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m01_005: If you come across any {LowercaseNextLetter}Jyoppa, would you mind\nsharing them with me?
MID_LGA_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m01: <BLN>I miss the flavor...
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m02_001: This is it! Jyoppa!
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m02_002: If you boil ornius innards in its juice, you can make a\npretty tasty stew!
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m02_003: Jyoppa skin can be bitter, but there's ways to bring\nout its flavor. Just peel it, soak it in honey, and enjoy!
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m02_004: Ahh... I can't tell you how much I missed this. It's so\ngood I almost don't want to eat it.
MID_LGV_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m02_005: I'm going to hurry home and cook. Thank you again!
MID_LGA_SQID_AguinhoShopping_B01_m02: <BLN>I should hurry home!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m01_001: *sigh* One of the forest peoples, called {LowercaseNextLetter}The Har Hali,\nstole some merchandise I was transporting.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m01_002: The thieves are out at the Secret Altar, but I'm not\nrisking another encounter with those terrors.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m01_003: It's odd—thieving is a bit out of character for them.\nYou seem tough enough. Can you get my goods back?
MID_LGA_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m01: <BLN>It won't be an easy fight...
MID_LGV_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m02_001: Thank goodness you got them back! The order was\nfrom one of my most valued clients.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m02_002: Strange to say, but this is the third time that these\n{Lowercase}Spellcaster's Relics{NormalCase} have been stolen.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m02_003: Maybe they give off some kind of magical attraction?\nHahaha! Wait, but do they...
MID_LGA_SQID_ReclaimAmulet_B01_m02: <BLN>It's just a theory...right?
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m01_001: Where have I seen you before? Oh, right! You're\nin the Heroic Games, aren't you?!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m01_002: I am leader of the Unerring Blades. Our legend\nresounds across all of Dagda!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m01_003: We let our guard down in our previous encounter.\nThis time it will be different!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m01_004: Meet us in Cape Damasen, where you will be granted\nthe honor of fighting us once more! We'll be waiting!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m01: <BLN>I've seen your face before...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m02_001: It was a good match. We fought honorably, each with\nour pride on the line...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m02_002: Both sides gave it our all!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleDamasen_B01_m02_003: But I cannot accept your victory! Sharpen your\nsword—we will meet again!
MID_LGV_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m01_001: Excuse me. Perhaps you'd lend me your aid...
MID_LGV_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m01_002: I wanted to give a special fish to the temple as an\noffering. Something a god would eat.
MID_LGV_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m01_003: I think a {LowercaseNextLetter}Rahlan would be perfect, and rumor has it\nthey can be caught in the Port of Pandora.
MID_LGV_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m01_004: Would you mind procuring one for me? I will be sure\nto reward you.
MID_LGA_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m01: <BLN>A rahlan would be good...
MID_LGV_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m02_001: So this is a {LowercaseNextLetter}Rahlan! My... Do all rare fish have such\nstrange appearances?
MID_LGV_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m02_002: These fins on its back almost look like wings. It's so\nelegant and graceful...like some divine messenger.
MID_LGV_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m02_003: This will make a fitting offering! Thank you for\nyour help.
MID_LGA_SQID_PandoraBargain_B01_m02: <BLN>This is perfect!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m01_001: Dagda is vast, and there are many ruins that hold\nmore questions than answers.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m01_002: Now, thought to be a cursed land, Krove Ditch has\nbecome such a one.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m01_003: Its former inhabitants are said to have degraded into\nwalking skeletons wandering about.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m01_004: Pity them. Free them. You'd do me a good turn,\nshould you slay every last one of them.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m01: <BLN>I pity them...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m02_001: Put them to rest, have you?
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m02_002: The truth is, I've done some digging through my\nfamily tree. Those bones...they were my ancestors.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m02_003: But with your help, it feels like I was finally able to\nlay them to rest. I owe you...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m02_004: They say there is a hot spring beneath those ruins.\nMaybe their souls can find some peace there.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleClove_B01_m02: <BLN>Be free...
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m01_001: I gift a jewel for our wedding anniversary each year,\nbut this year I want to give something extra special.
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m01_002: A beautiful and renowned Aegina crystal would be\nperfect. They can be found in Pyroxene Cave...
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m01_003: But if I make an excursion to the cave, my partner\nwill know, and I'd rather the gift be a surprise.
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m01_004: If you have any errands that would take you out\nthat way, perhaps you could mine one for me?
MID_LGA_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m01: <BLN>It needs to be a surprise...
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m02_001: You've brought me a crystal? Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m02_002: Look at that glow! This will make a perfect gift. Now\nto hire a jeweler who can fashion it.
MID_LGV_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m02_003: Should it hang on a necklace? Or perhaps it should\nadorn a brooch? Hmm, decisions...
MID_LGA_SQID_SearchingJewelry_B01_m02: <BLN>I can't decide...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m01_001: The children were attacked by huge birds!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m01_002: No, not {LowercaseNextLetter}Orniuses! These things were as big as\nan elephant!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m01_003: The beasts attacked near Lake Brontes. They scared\nme so bad that I can't work. I can't...anything!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m01_004: Someone needs to get rid of them!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m01: <BLN>They were as big as an elephant!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m02_001: Did you take care of those terrible birds?\nOh, thank you! Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m02_002: The children are scared even of small birds. They run\nfor their lives when one lands nearby.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m02_003: Now I can tell them that everything is OK.\nHopefully, they'll calm down soon.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m02_004: I have an idea! I'll create a feast of the bird's meat.\nThat will help them overcome their fear.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleGalgo_B01_m02: <BLN>I can tell them they're safe now... 
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m01_001: Have you ever seen a {LowercaseNextLetter}Golem? The best that I can\ndescribe them is they're like giant, moving statues.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m01_002: Word is that there are some rampaging in the\nKurdelind Ruins.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m01_003: The ruins could collapse if they keep at it! \nBut fighting them is beyond me...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m01_004: You seem like you're good in a fight. Do you think\nyou could put a stop to them?
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m01: <BLN>The ruins could collapse...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m02_001: You did it? You destroyed the golems?! Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m02_002: Golems are such a pain. You can't attack when\nthey're asleep, because they never sleep!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m02_003: You can't lay traps for them because they don't eat. \nHow did you manage to defeat them?
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m02_004: You just fought them? Ha! I get it. That's a good joke!\nYou're funny and reliable. I might call on you again.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleTartarus_B01_m02: <BLN>Aren't they a pain?
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m01_001: Hey there. I collect rare coins from all over Dagda.
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m01_002: I came to Dagsion to snag a Djilu coin, but the person\nI was supposed to buy it from isn't here...
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m01_003: I spoke to their family, and apparently the seller went\nmissing around Giant's-Print Fort.
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m01_004: I wonder... Could the coin still be there? If it is, could\nyou get it for me?
MID_LGA_SQID_StandUp_B01_m01: <BLN>Why in such a place...
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m02_001: This pattern...the deterioration of the material...the\ncasting quirks... This is definitely a Djilu coin!
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m02_002: But what of the owner? Does this mean\nthey're...gone?
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m02_003: I see... In that case, it's best I return this coin to their\nfamily. Thank you for your efforts. Here, take this.
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m02_004: Hm? You're wondering why I'm still paying you?\nBecause you still completed your part.
MID_LGV_SQID_StandUp_B01_m02_005: An item this valuable being lost to the world would\nhave been a real tragedy.
MID_LGA_SQID_StandUp_B01_m02: <BLN>Thank you for your efforts.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m01_001: Where have I seen you before? Oh, right! You're\nin the Heroic Games, aren't you?!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m01_002: I am leader of the Unerring Blades. Our legend\nresounds across all of Dagda!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m01_003: You have defeated us handily in our previous duels,\nbut this time we are prepared!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m01_004: We will end this rivalry forever on Mount Ouranos.\nShow a spine and meet us there!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m01: <BLN>I've seen your face before...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m02_002: We lost. Again. Even after all our training in\nthe mountains...we lost.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m02_001: Perhaps we rushed it. We should have trained more\nbefore challenging you! Yes, that's it!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m02_003: Ugh. No. I know that's not it. We didn't train to give\nour all at any moment. Not like you have.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleUranus_B01_m02_004: I admit it! You are worthy of your spot in the Heroic\nGames! Good luck in your battles, and farewell!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m01_001: This is outrageous! I am outraged! Hey! You!\nYou're outraged by this too, aren't you?!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m01_002: My astronomical observation records were stolen!\nThe location of every star in the night sky...gone!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m01_003: And I know who's responsible! Ohhh, I know!\nStar-Spurning Bows is behind this outrage!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m01_004: Those fools fear the stars and see the night sky as an\nabomination. Please, get my records back from them!
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m01: <BLN>Outrageous!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m02_001: Thank you for reclaiming these observations from\nthose fools. These are truly irreplaceable.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m02_002: Why do you suspect they are so afraid of the stars?
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m02_003: Perhaps they fear something terrifying lurks beyond\nthe veil of the night sky.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleTower_B01_m02: <BLN>Why are they so afraid?
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m01_001: Have you got a moment? I need some help.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m01_002: My fellow hunters are missing! They entered \nFaun's Forest and haven't been seen since!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m01_003: I've heard there's a group of spellcasters who live\nthere. Word is that they kidnap people!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m01_004: I asked around, and people are missing from all the\nvillages near the forest!
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m01_005: I'm worried my friends, and everyone else who's\nmissing, might be held captive in the forest.
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m01_006: Can you please find where the spellcasters are\nhiding and rescue everyone?
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m01: <BLN>People are missing...
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m02_001: While you were fighting the spellcasters, I searched\nfor those who have gone missing... 
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m02_002: I couldn't find anyone. No trace. Not even a body.\nWhat do you suppose that means?
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m02_003: Were they taken somewhere else? What do you\nsuppose is going on?
MID_LGV_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m02_004: I may be more confused than ever, but thank you for\nthe help. Here, I have a reward for you.
MID_LGA_SQID_BattleLakeside_B01_m02: <BLN>What could it mean?
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m01_001: Hey, you know the man standing by the inn?\nWell, we've actually been dating for a while.
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m01_002: I want to get him something special for his birthday,\nbut I need more info on what he likes.
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m01_003: Could I ask you to do some sneaky investigating\nfor me?
MID_LGA_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m01: <BLN>I need to know more...
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m02_001: I see! So that's what he likes!
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m02_002: Great! Now all I need to know is his name, where he\nlives—OH! And his birthday! Hehe...hehehe...
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m02_003: Hehe... Hehehe... Aha! Ahahahahaaa! Ahhh...
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m02_004: Oh, are you still standing there? You can leave now.
MID_LGA_SQID_HeartfulGift_B01_m02: <BLN>Hehe... Now all I need is...
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B02_m01_001: What? You want to know what kind of gifts I like?\nOdd thing to ask a stranger, don't you think?
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B02_m01_002: Oh, you're a merchant in training? Well, in that case,\nI'd be happy to help. Let me see...
MID_LGV_SQID_HeartfulGift_B02_m01_003: I guess I like ghosh and delicacies. With those two\nthings, what else could I possibly need?
MID_LGA_SQID_HeartfulGift_B02_m02: <BLN>Hmm...
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m01_001: Promised One, could you please spare some food?\nIt's not for me—it's for my {Lowercase}War Elephant{NormalCase}s.
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m01_002: I owe my survival to them, but I was injured recently\nand can't gather all the food they need.
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m01_003: I want to give them a vegetable called {LowercaseNextLetter}Hakuren. It's a\nrare plant that only grows in certain places.
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m01_004: I recall once picking some near three rocks in a row.\nSorry I can't give you more, but we need your help!
MID_LGA_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m01: <BLN>Spare some vegetables for me?
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m02_001: Amazing! My time on the battlefield is over, but I'm\nglad my elephants are thriving again. Thank you.
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m02_002: I know I've asked a lot of you already...but would you\nconsider adopting my {Lowercase}War Elephant{NormalCase}s for your army?
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m02_003: I may be too wounded to fight anymore, but my\nelephants are healthy and ready for combat!
MID_LGV_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m02_004: I'm sure you can think of a use for them!
MID_LGA_SQID_HungryElefant_B01_m02: <BLN>I just know they'll serve you well!
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01_001: You must be the Promised One. I have heard about\nyour exploits.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01_002: Despite my status as a deity of this land, I find I have\nno choice but to entrust its future to you humans.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01_003: I loathe my own weakness...but I cannot let that stop\nme from taking responsibility.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01_004: As the wife of the Divine Emperor, and as the head\nof the surviving gods of Dagda, I have a favor to ask.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01_005: It is something of a personal matter.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01_006: Regardless of how he met his end, I loved the Divine\nEmperor with all my heart.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01_007: If at all possible, can you fetch me at least one\nkeepsake of his?
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01_008: All I ask is something to remember him by. I know\nthat this may seem like a frivolous request.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01_009: But if you do this for me, I will grant permission for\nyou to take the exam for a higher-ranking class.
MID_LGA_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m01: <BLN>I have a favor to ask.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_001: This must be his... Thank you so much.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_002: I owe you a great deal for granting my request.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_003: And I will compensate you appropriately,\nPromised One.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_004: First, I'll see to it that you can take the exam for the\nelevated class, {LowercaseNextLetter}Valkyrium.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_005: Next, I shall grant permission for you to use my\ntemple's Gate of the Gods whenever you want.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_006: Finally, I would like you to use the Supreme Arc held\nby my temple. It is a powerful artifact.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_007: Though in order to use the Arc, one must overcome\nmy temple's trials first.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_008: If you wish to undertake this challenge, speak to the\npriest in my temple's main hall.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_009: Now then...if you'll excuse me, I'll be heading off\nto Dagsion.
MID_LGV_SQID_JuraRequest_Jun_m02_010: May there be light on your path ahead.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01_001: Ah, the much discussed Promised One. I've been\nhoping to meet you.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01_002: I hear it's thanks to you this land hasn't totally slid\ninto chaos.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01_003: The forces of the underworld are formidable...unlike\nany foe I've faced.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01_004: But maybe my temple can aid you in your struggle.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01_005: With that in mind, I need a favor.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01_006: Some blackguard stole my Golden Helm.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01_007: There are reports of a strange character holing up in\na cave nearby... I wonder if that's who did it.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01_008: Unfortunately, the Bringer of War can't take action\nagainst lowly bandits. Would you do it?
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01_009: I want my helmet back. Succeed and I'll let you learn\na high-ranking class—among other things.
MID_LGA_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m01: <BLN>I need a favor.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_001: Thanks. I hope you didn't mind the trouble.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_002: The truth is, I wanted to see your skills in action,\nso I put on a little production.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_003: By way of apology, I'll give you three rewards.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_004: First, I'll let you take the certification exam for the\n{LowercaseNextLetter}Swordmaster class.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_005: I'll also allow you to use the Gate of the Gods here at\nmy temple.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_006: Finally, I'll give you a chance to earn the Arc in my\npossession.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_007: You'll have to undertake the temple's trial in order to\nuse it. But I'm sure you'll have no trouble with that.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_008: Just go and talk to the priest and give it a try.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_009: Understood? Good. Now, I think I'll head to Dagsion.
MID_LGV_SQID_MarsRequest_Mar_m02_010: I'll be watching your progress. Until next time.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_001: Hello there. Welcome, Promised One. You must have\ncome a long way if you've found yourself here.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_002: Word of you has traveled all the way to this place,\nso far from Dagsion itself.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_003: The forces of the underworld show no mercy. I've\ngot to say...I can't stand them.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_004: Ah, yes. There is something I'd like to ask of you.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_005: Have you heard of the Iapetus Cavern? It's been\ngiving me something of a headache lately.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_006: The flames from the Mountain of Fire have flowed\ninto the cavern, blocking any entry.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_007: Casting Fimbulvetr Night at those flames would put\nthem out. But I'm out of that particular magic tome.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_008: I gave that tome to Jurah quite some time ago. I'd\nsuggest that you ask her for it at her temple.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_009: I would appreciate you handling this in my place.\nIt'd be a great help.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01_010: In return, I'll give you something useful for your\nbattling—a chance to attempt a special master class.
MID_LGA_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m01: <BLN>Thanks for coming all this way.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02_001: Well, it looks like you managed to put out the flames\nsafely. Thank you. This has been a great help.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02_002: That cave has been a handy spot for gathering\nmaterials for my magic experiments.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02_003: I promised you a reward. I'll arrange for you to\nattempt the {Lowercase}High Savant{NormalCase} exam.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02_004: I've also decided to let you use the Gate of the Gods\nin this temple from now on.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02_005: Finally, as a special treat, I'll give you a rare\nopportunity to use a Supreme Arc that I possess.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02_006: There are rules for using such Arcs, you see. You\nmust first complete the temple's trial.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02_007: I doubt you'll have any trouble with it, however.\nSpeak with the priests if you'd like to try.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02_008: With that, I think I should check on the state of\nthings in Dagsion.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Smi_m02_009: Thank you again for your help. I'll be sure to ask you\nfor anything more I need done in the future.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_B01_m01_001: Ah, if it isn't the Promised One! What can I\ndo for you?
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_B01_m01_002: A Fimbulvetr Night tome? We do have such a book in\nsecure care at our temple.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_B01_m01_003: It's a tome that Jurah once borrowed from\nSmyrnos himself.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_B01_m01_004: So, if this is at Smyrnos's request, I have no reason\nto deny your taking it away.
MID_LGA_SQID_SmirnothRequest_B01_m01: <BLN>In search of something?
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m01_001: This is the place Smyrnos told us about, hmm?\nLet's not waste time. Try using Fimbulvetr Night!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m02_001: It seems to have had no trouble putting out the flames.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m03_001: Hrm. The flames are burning too fiercely to proceed.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m03_002: This must be the place Smyrnos was talking about.\n'Tis a problem, no doubt.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m03_003: You should have someone learn Fimbulvetr Night before\nwe return to try again.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmirnothRequest_Ism_m04_001: The fierce flames are blocking any progress.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_001: Hi there, Promised One. Sorry that I didn't make\nmy appearance until now.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_002: We've taken in what refugees we could, with the\nhelp of Angelos and the temple soldiers.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_003: Fighting off underworld forces day after day,\nbarely surviving...
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_004: I'm confident that your efforts will tip the scales.\nWe will win this fight. I'm sure of it.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_005: Could you do me a favor, Promised One?
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_006: I want to restore this temple's Gate of the Gods.\nI suspect you'd find that useful too.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_007: I once broke it myself, you know—owing to certain\ncircumstances in the past.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_008: We're low on materials to repair it. I'd like you to\nfind what I need.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_009: It's a mineral known as {LowercaseNextLetter}Sunstone. But this gate\nwon't operate with any normal {LowercaseNextLetter}Sunstone.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_010: I need some that's brimming with sunlight—full\nright to the limit. You can find it in a special place.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01_011: Would you get it for me? If you can, I'll let you take\non a high-tier class exam as a reward.
MID_LGA_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m01: <BLN>Could you do me a favor?
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02_001: This is exactly what I needed! There's plenty of\npower in these minerals.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02_002: Good job. Now I can repair the Gate of the Gods\nimmediately.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02_003: Feel free to use the Gate from now on. You may have\nneed of it in your battles to come.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02_004: And speaking of battles... I'll now let you take the\nexam for the {Lowercase}Great Knight{NormalCase} class.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02_005: Oh, and one more thing. You'd find a Supreme Arc\nuseful, wouldn't you?
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02_006: I'd be glad to hand one over, but you'll have to pass a\ntrial before you can have it. Rules, rules...
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02_007: Simply talk to the temple folks if you want to take\nthe trial. After that, it'll be yours to enjoy.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02_008: I may as well test this Gate here with a trip to\nDagsion.
MID_LGV_SQID_ClairRequest_Cla_m02_009: Any time you run into trouble, Promised One, be\nsure to consult me for help. Goodbye for now!
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_001: The Promised One. I've heard tell of your efforts.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_002: I thank you for coming out here in the midst of so\nmany dangers...
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_003: And I will do my utmost to assist you as I can.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_004: Although...I also have a favor to ask.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_005: At this terrible time, many are overcome with dread\nand unable to feel hope for the future.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_006: I would like to bring them a measure of ease.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_007: As painful as it is to admit, in these times,\nart and music alone can't help the people.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_008: So, I thought I'd make and send out amulets that\nrepel evil. But I simply don't have the materials.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_009: If you happen to find them during your travels,\ncould I trouble you to bring them to me?
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01_010: I will compensate you, of course—I can grant you the\nability to take on a more advanced class.
MID_LGA_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m01: <BLN>I have a favor to ask.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_001: Ah yes, this fragrant wood should be perfect for\nmaking the amulets.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_002: I know this will only do so much to calm the\npeople's hearts.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_003: But if it brings even a little hope, it's worth it.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_004: I never doubted you'd succeed, Promised One,\nbut I'm impressed you found it all in these times!
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_005: And as for the reward I promised. You can now take\nthe exam for the master archer class, {Lowercase}Bow Knight{NormalCase}.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_006: In addition, the Gate of the Gods at my temple will \nbe open to you. Use it whenever you need.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_007: Lastly...the battles ahead will only grow more and\nmore difficult. Would you like an Arc?
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_008: I cannot give it to you for nothing, I'm afraid. You'd\nhave to take the test at my temple.
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_009: Now, many people have gathered in Dagsion,\nseeking hope...
MID_LGV_SQID_CaraRequest_Car_m02_010: I shall make my way to the capital and hand them\nthese amulets. Farewell.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_001: Thank you for coming, Promised One.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_002: I want you to know that we're doing all we can to\ntreat the injured and help refugees.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_003: Everyone is fighting to survive this dark time.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_004: But I believe that fight is only possible because you\ninspire them to hold hope in their hearts.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_005: On that front, there is something I need to ask\nof you.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_006: We are desperately short on medicine, with no new\nsupplies coming our way.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_007: The shortage is felt everywhere, and the temple\nmust not hoard its supply.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_008: I don't need the finished medication to help. If I can\nget hold of the ingredients...
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_009: I should be able to make medicine using the recipe I\nlearned from my uncle Smyrnos a long time ago.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_010: I'd be happy to compensate you for the trouble of\ngathering the ingredients for me.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m01_011: Perhaps you'd be interested in taking a master class\nexam? Let's talk once you've found the ingredients.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m02_001: You've gathered the ingredients I asked for?
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m02_002: This will help us to save many lives. Thank you\nso much.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m02_003: Your work has saved so many people. I want to help\nin any way I can.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m02_004: So, as promised, you can now take the {Lowercase}War Monk{NormalCase}\ncertification exam.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m02_005: Also, I'll open the Gate of the Gods to this temple.\nFeel free to use it whenever you need!
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m02_006: I will also arrange for you to take on the trial at\nmy temple.
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m02_007: Overcoming that trial will allow you to use my Arc.\nI imagine you'll find it very useful in battle!
MID_LGV_SQID_AuroraRequest_Aur_m02_008: Just speak to someone at the temple to take the trial\nanytime you like.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m01_001: Promised One! Those who survived the age of\ndespair are flocking to Dagsion in droves.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m01_002: By rebuilding Dagsion, maybe we can show people\nthere's still hope that the world can be normal again.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m01_003: First, we want to start with the arena, but we're still\nlacking some supplies...
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m01_004: Would you be willing to help us gather building\nmaterials for the construction effort?
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m01: <BLN>Reconstruction volunteers wanted!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m03_001: You can probably find {Lowercase}Building Materials{NormalCase} all over\nthe continent.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m03_002: When you're available to help out, come find me by\nthe {LowercaseNextLetter}Arena.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m02_001: You really gathered the {Lowercase}Building Materials{NormalCase}? Thank\nyou, Promised One! It couldn't have been easy.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m02_002: I won't let these go to waste, I promise. We'll give\neverything we have to rebuilding the arena.
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionArena1_B01_m02: <BLN>We'll get it done no matter what!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m01_001: Promised One! The arena's reconstruction is moving\nalong well. It's truly a miracle, how far we've come.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m01_002: It's proof that the people's hope is mounting. They're\nrealizing that we can heal the world if we try.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m01_003: But we still need your help. We'll need more supplies\nbefore we can complete the arena.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m01_004: In order to improve the training grounds, we'll need\nmore {Lowercase}Building Materials{NormalCase}. Could you gather some?
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m01: <BLN>We're getting closer!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m02_001: Wonderful! These supplies will go a long way. We'll\nget the arena back to its former glory.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m02_002: And once we do, it'll be a beacon of hope for the\npeople. Thank you, Promised One. Truly.
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionArena2_B01_m02: <BLN>You did it! Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining1_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining1_B01_m01_001: The {LowercaseNextLetter}Inn's kitchen is completely destroyed... We can't\nserve any food like this.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining1_B01_m01_002: We also can't gather the materials to fix it... If you\nhappen to have any extra, we could really use them.
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionDining1_B01_m01: <BLN>Sorry, we aren't serving right now.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining1_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining1_B01_m02_001: You'll really share these materials with us?!\nThank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining1_B01_m02_002: We can finally cook again! Please, come and eat\nanytime you want!
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionDining1_B01_m02: <BLN>Come eat!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining2_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining2_B01_m01_001: Oh, Promised One! Our patrons have been thrilled\nthat we're finally cooking again!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining2_B01_m01_002: If you had more materials, we'd be able to improve\nthe kitchen and make our food even tastier!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining2_B01_m01_003: I'm sure everyone needs help nowadays, but if you\nhave any extra supplies, please let me know.
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionDining2_B01_m01: <BLN>We could make even tastier food...
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining2_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining2_B01_m02_001: You brought us materials again?! Now the kitchen\nwill be completely back to how it used to be!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionDining2_B01_m02_002: You've helped spread smiles today, Promised One.\nPlease, come by and have a meal soon!
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionDining2_B01_m02: <BLN>Everyone is smiling again!
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m01_001: Each temple still gets visited by their fair share of\nworshippers. Some of them, anxious...others, sad.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m01_002: We were short on priests at first, but we've managed\nto start recruiting apprentices and senior priests.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m01_003: But since the temples have been abandoned for so\nlong, we're low on supplies for prayer ceremonies.
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m01_004: With materials, we would have what we need\nfor prayer. Would you be willing to donate them?
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m01: <BLN>Might I talk to you a moment?
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m02_001: You actually gathered the materials...
MID_LGV_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m02_002: Thank you! I pray the gods always keep you in their\ndivine protection.
MID_LGA_SQID_ReconstructionTemple_B01_m02: <BLN>May they watch over you...
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m01_001: Hey there. I've seen enough matches to tell you're\npretty strong.
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m01_002: So I have a request for someone with your strength! \nDefeat those {LowercaseNextLetter}Rogues hanging around the square!
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m01_003: I came here to watch the Heroic Games, but those\nbrutes stole my admission fee...
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m01_004: I've come too far to just turn around and go home.\nIf you can help me out, I'll pay you for your trouble.
MID_LGA_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m01: <BLN>I can't just go home...
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m02_001: You defeated them! Thank you! I hope you don't\nmind... I watched the whole thing in secret.
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m02_002: Oh, right, the admission fee they stole from me...\nWhy don't you keep it.
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m02_003: I've decided not to stay for the Heroic Games\nafter all. I think it's best I just head home.
MID_LGV_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m02_004: The way you fought was truly impressive. Excellent,\neven! It was more than enough excitement for me.
MID_LGA_SQID_LittleRevenge_B01_m02: <BLN>That was truly impressive!
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m01_001: Are you familiar with the common {Lowercase}Blight Louse{NormalCase}?\nThey're creepy insects that live in damp places.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m01_002: Yet, creepy as they are, they are known to produce\nbeautiful stones in their guts called {Lowercase}Insect Pearls{NormalCase}.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m01_003: Well, I say that, but in truth it's only maybe one in\na hundred that do. That rarity excites the nobles.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m01_004: If you ever come into possession of any, let me know.\nI'm prepared to buy them for a high price.
MID_LGA_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m01: <BLN>Such beauty...
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m02_001: You found some?! They're so rare, I admit that it's\nbeen some time since I've seen a real sample.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m02_002: You must be quite the expert blight-louse slayer!\nI may call on you again but, for now, thank you!
MID_LGA_SQID_RarePearl1_B01_m02: <BLN>I may call on you again...
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m01_001: A certain noble client of mine was quite pleased that\nI had an {Lowercase}Insect Pearl{NormalCase} available.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m01_002: They were also rather vocal in their desire for more.\nIdeally, some larger samples.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m01_003: I've been given strict orders by the head of the\ntrading company to procure more. Immediately.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m01_004: Alas, they're not so easy to come by... Unless you're\na bug-killing expert.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m01_005: Given your skills, I hope you might find some more.\nI'll buy any you find for quite a high price.
MID_LGA_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m01: <BLN>I must procure more pearls...
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m02_001: Oh, look at this. The client will be most pleased!
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m02_002: Apparently certain nobles crush a pearl to powder to\ndrink in their wine. They say it's good for beauty.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m02_003: The minds of nobles are beyond any understanding.\nHow can the chancellor of a country truly believe...
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m02_004: But I've said too much. Pretend you didn't hear that.
MID_LGA_SQID_RarePearl2_B01_m02: <BLN>The client will be pleased!
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m01_001: Oh! You! I've been hoping to see you, and now here\nyou are! And just in time!
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m01_002: I find myself in a bit of an unpleasant situation with\none of my more important clients.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m01_003: And, to make amends, I must deliver a huge quantity\nof, you may have predicted, {Lowercase}Insect Pearl{NormalCase}s.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m01_004: I trust you can source them for me?
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m01_005: I'm counting on you. Please hurry!
MID_LGA_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m01: <BLN>Well, this is unpleasant...
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B02_m01_001: Wanna hear something weird? I've been told that in\nsome of the more remote port towns...
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B02_m01_002: you can get {Lowercase}Insect Pearl{NormalCase}s for cheap. I guess the rubes\nhaven't heard how valuable them things are.
MID_LGA_SQID_RarePearl3_B02_m01: <BLN>You gonna stock up on 'em?
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m02_001: You found some! You've saved my proverbial hide...\nAnd perhaps my literal hide as well. Thank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m02_002: The client's trust in our company will be repaired!\nI—no, the whole company is indebted to you.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m02_003: I can never hope to repay you for this favor.
MID_LGV_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m02_004: But I offer you this reward all the same.\nAgain, I thank you!
MID_LGA_SQID_RarePearl3_B01_m02: <BLN>You saved me!
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m01_001: Y-you there... Please, you have to help me...\nI'm...dying!
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m01_002: I've run out of ga...garum. Without it, I... I can't take\nanother step...
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m01_003: Hurry, please! Hurry and bring me garum...
MID_LGA_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m01: <BLN>Help...anyone...
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m02_001: Oh, garum! My beloved black dew!
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m02_002: The taste! The aroma! Phew! I feel alive again...\nThank you!
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m02_003: I have to admit, I'm something of a gourmand. But I\nespecially can't resist dishes that have garum!
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m02_004: But not just breakfast, lunch, and dinner! No way!\nI love it in desserts and drinks too!
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m02_005: I was putting it on everything, and before I knew it,\nmy stash was gone! I thought I was done for!
MID_LGV_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m02_006: But then you brought me some of the best garum I've\never had! Ha! I'll be sure to call on you more often!
MID_LGA_SQID_GarmCommitment1_B01_m02: <BLN>I'm ALIIIVE!
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m01_001: Haven't you come along at just the right moment?\nI've got something important that needs doing.
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m01_002: I can't say much, but a while back something was\nstolen from... You know, it's not important where.
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m01_003: All that matters is that I've been looking for it for\nyears, and I finally found out where it is.
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m01_004: Ever hear of the Iapetus Cavern? It's in Solidus, just\nnorthwest of the kingdom of Arago.
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m01_005: I sent some people to find it, but no luck.
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m01_006: Now I'm looking for more competent folks for the job.\nThe kind who won't ask unnecessary questions.
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m01_007: Does that sound like you? There's a generous reward,\nincluding a little extra for you to keep quiet.
MID_LGA_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m01: <BLN>...
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m02_001: It looks legit. Let me see... Well done! This is exactly\nwhat I was after!
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m02_002: Heh, this'll make the boss happy. I'm glad I asked\nyou to do the job.
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m02_003: If you don't mind me saying so, it's impressive how\nyou came back in one piece.
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m02_004: Here, take this. It's the reward I promised. Now you\ngo and forget we ever talked, understand?
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m02_005: I actually like you a lot, so I'd rather not be asked to\nshut you up.
MID_LGV_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m02_006: Ha! I'm kidding. It's a joke. I couldn't take you even\nwith help. Forget I said anything. 
MID_LGA_SQID_RelicRecovery_B01_m02: <BLN>Thanks. Now get out of here.
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m01_001: Have you ever used a Da Mina weapon? Every true\nwarrior knows that they're masterpieces, to be sure.
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m01_002: They're forged exclusively in the land of Da Mina,\nwith a method that's kept strictly confidential.
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m01_003: I have a client who's asked me to procure quite a\nfew of them.
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m01_004: But the issue lies in their rarity. I haven't been able\nto collect as many as I'd hoped.
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m01_005: If you have time, can you lend me a hand? Deliver\nthem to me and I'll pay double the market price.
MID_LGA_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m01: <BLN>At this rate...
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m02_001: What?! You brought these for me? Haha! It's a \ndream come true!
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m02_002: You must've had more free time than I thought.\nThis is incredibly generous. Thanks a lot.
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m02_003: What will my client do with all these Da Mina\nweapons, I wonder...
MID_LGV_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m02_004: Well, never mind. Prying doesn't pay.
MID_LGA_SQID_DaMinaDelivery_B01_m02: <BLN>It's a dream come true!
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m01_001: Our organization is dedicated to the study of both the\nmysterious properties and potential of {LowercaseNextLetter}Flamma.
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m01_002: Flamma is a powerful substance obtained by\nprocessing human life and souls.
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m01_003: It originates from research into a material known as\nsoul crystals.
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m01_004: Our own research is at an impasse, and we need a\nnew approach.
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m01_005: I believe that we require a true sample of a soul\ncrystal to make progress.
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m01_006: I'd never have approached you with this request\nmyself, so it must be fate that you spoke to me.
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m01_007: If you ever happen to find a soul crystal, would you\nbring it to me?
MID_LGA_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m01: <BLN>My research is stalled...
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m02_001: A soul crystal? This is a REAL soul crystal?!
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m02_002: Just who are you, really, that you were able to obtain\none so easily?
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m02_003: I was wrong. It wasn't fate that brought us together.\nThis was a blessing from the gods themselves.
MID_LGV_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m02_004: Our research should make great strides now.\nThank you!
MID_LGA_SQID_SoulCrystal_B01_m02: <BLN>It's a blessing!
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01_001: I am a subordinate of General Senghor, commander\nof the Eleventh Division of the Dagdan Empire.
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01_002: Have you heard of the artist Shandor? He was a\ngenius sculptor with legendary pieces.
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01_003: In his lifetime, he completed statues of the four\ngoddesses, Yu Phas, Kalla, Jurah, and Fortuna.
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01_004: They're magnificent works alone but, together,\nthey're known as "Shandor's Legacy."
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01_005: They say he hid the statues across four lands. But the\nexact locations are still unknown. We suspect...
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01_006: the "temple" to the east, the "pass" to the north, the\n"grassland" to the west, and the "lake" to the south.
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01_007: The general is searching for them. Not to own them\nhimself, but to gift them to the empire!
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01_008: If you find them and deliver them to me, the reward\nwould be generous!
MID_LGA_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m01: <BLN>Where could they be?
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m02_001: Oh... so this is the work of a legendary sculptor,\nsought by countless people!
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m02_002: They're all splendid on their own, but when lined up\ntogether, they harmonize into even greater beauty...
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m02_003: I cannot express it in words. It's the pinnacle of\nart, truly Shandor's Legacy!
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m02_004: The general is sure to be pleased!
MID_LGV_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m02_005: Here. The reward as promised! Thank you again!
MID_LGA_SQID_SandorLegacy_B01_m02: <BLN>Splendid!
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m01_001: I'm from Aguiño, a village in Melias. 
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m01_002: Our village is constantly raided by thieves. If this\ncontinues... I'm at my wit's end! This can't go on!
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m01_003: With the help of the other villagers, I've scraped\ntogether what few goods and coins I can.
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m01_004: If you can drive away the thieves, then I'll give\nyou all of it. Please! Save our village!
MID_LGA_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m01: <BLN>If this continues...
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m02_001: The thieves are gone, and you've saved us all!
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m02_002: Things didn't use to be like this. But lately, very bad\npeople have found followers.
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m02_003: You showed they can be beaten! We're going to train\nand learn to fight, just like you!
MID_LGV_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m02_004: That should make them think twice the next time\nthey're tempted to attack us.
MID_LGA_SQID_VillageDefense_B01_m02: <BLN>We're going to train to fight!
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m01_001: One of our customers has been on my mind.\nHis name's Gaston—a tableware craftsman.
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m01_002: He was one of the regulars, but I haven't seen him in\nthe tavern at all lately.
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m01_003: I did tell him not to come back until he could pay off\nhis tab.
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m01_004: But I don't know. The man loves a drink. I'm worried\nhe might have died.
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m01_005: Would you mind looking in on him? I can show you\nwhere he lives.
MID_LGA_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m01: <BLN>Still no sign of him.
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m02_001: That Gaston. So that's what he was up to. In any\ncase, I'm glad he's safe. 
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m02_002: New cups, huh? I'm sure they'd improve sales.\nSomething to look forward to.
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m02_003: But...won't that mean Gaston drinks more, and\nowes an even bigger amount?
MID_LGA_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B01_m02: <BLN>Not a terrible idea...
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B02_m01_001: Yeah, I'm Gaston. The tavern worker was that\nworried about me?!
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B02_m01_002: Thanks for going to the trouble of checking on me.\nI guess it makes sense she was worried!
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B02_m01_003: But see, she told me to pay off my bar tab, and I\ndon't have any money.
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B02_m01_004: So, I made a new kind of cup. Take a look! The\nbottoms are conical, so you can't put them down.
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B02_m01_005: You buy a drink, you have to keep holding it until\nit's done. The tavern will sell even more booze!
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B02_m01_006: I'm just in the prototyping stages, but when it's\nready, I'll pay my tab with it.
MID_LGV_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B02_m01_007: Tell her I'll be back soon!
MID_LGA_SQID_BarkeeperTroubles_B02_m01: <BLN>Almost ready.
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m01_001: Hey, the name's Royu. I'm a researcher specializing\nin rare stones here in Dagsion.
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m01_002: Actually... I find myself in need of a certain stone for\na research experiment I'm currently working on.
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m01_003: In the past, I'd grab my trusty pickax and chisel and\ngo collect them myself, but...
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m01_004: *sigh* My back is completely shot. I can't even walk\nupstairs most days, let alone delve into the mines.
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m01_005: The stone I'm looking for is called {LowercaseNextLetter}Ouranotite! If you\ndon't mind, could you please collect some for me?
MID_LGA_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m01: <BLN>Ugh, my back...
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m02_001: You brought the {LowercaseNextLetter}Ouranotite! You might be young, but\nyou've got some real skill!
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m02_002: Now I can continue my experiments without any\nworries!
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m02_003: I'm trying to create a hot spring using minerals\nwith healing properties.
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m02_004: I'll use said spring to heal my back so I can travel\ninto the mines again! I should get started! Thanks!
MID_LGA_SQID_CollectingStones1_B01_m02: <BLN>Thanks for the help.
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B02_m01_001: Stones are all Mr. Royu talks about. Most days, he\njust spends all of his time staring at them.
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B02_m01_002: I guess he's what you'd call..."odd," to put it simply.
MID_LGV_SQID_CollectingStones1_B02_m01_003: But apparently, he served at the temple of Smyrnos\nin his youth, so that probably counts for something.
MID_LGA_SQID_CollectingStones1_B02_m01: <BLN>That man...
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m01_001: Once, I lived among the People of the White Egg.
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m01_002: But I ran afoul of the village's rules and was\nbanished. I've not returned there since.
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m01_003: And, at my age, I've no desire to go back either!\nBut I admit there's one thing I do miss...
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m01_004: Sandworm meat. I remember the taste well, and I\nmiss it dearly.
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m01_005: Say, youngster, if you have any sandworm meat\non you, do you mind sharing a little with me?
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m01_006: I want to enjoy that taste again before I die.\nThere's nothing else like it in the world.
MID_LGA_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m01: <BLN>I remember it well...
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m02_001: Oh, hehe, yes! This is the stuff! The smell, the flavor,\neven the color—it's all exactly as I remember!
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m02_002: I've tasted many far more delicious things in my life,\nbut when I was young this was the finest of treats.
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m02_003: I loved it so much that I broke into the larders and\ndevoured all that I could!
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m02_004: Then they tossed me out of the village and I never\nhad another bite...
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m02_005: It should be a bitter memory, I feel. But, instead, it\nfills me with love for a lost time...
MID_LGV_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m02_006: Thank you for the trouble it took to get this. If you\ncan visit your homeland, do so before you're old.
MID_LGA_SQID_UnforgettableTaste_B01_m02: <BLN>Just like I remember...
MID_LGV_SQID_Relief1_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_Relief1_B01_m01_001: Promised One, an urgent message via a swift rider!\nCenturio is in trouble!
MID_LGV_SQID_Relief1_B01_m01_002: He's come under attack by risen dead while escorting\nan unidentified person of some importance.
MID_LGV_SQID_Relief1_B01_m01_003: He's fighting at Elissa Pass and needs help as soon\nas you can!
MID_LGA_SQID_Relief1_B01_m01: <BLN>An urgent message!
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m01_001: Hey, you there... Could I ask you a small favor?
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m01_002: Perhaps you've seen all the mysterious ruins\nscattered throughout Dagda?
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m01_003: They're fascinating, aren't they? I've actually been\nsending people to investigate them here and there.
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m01_004: But the expedition I dispatched to a place called\n"Heretics' Cave" has gone silent...
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m01_005: I'm starting to worry about them. Could I ask you to\ncheck on their safety?
MID_LGA_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m01: <BLN>I hope they're alright...
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m02_001: So, you couldn't find them... They must have been\ncaught up in some kind of accident.
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m02_002: Many of the ruins were built with advanced\ntechniques that still remain a mystery.
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m02_003: If we could just acquire that knowledge, imagine\nthe profits it could earn...
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m02_004: At least, that was the idea... Can't say this expedition\nwas worth the expense, but that's business.
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m02_005: There's still money to be made here, so we'll just\nraise more funds and try again.
MID_LGA_SQID_ResearchTeam_B01_m02: <BLN>We'll have to start over later.
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m01_001: <TLP>Investigation Log: Febrai 22, 1449\nUpon reaching the deepest part of "Heretics' Cave," we were stunned\nwhen a strange object appeared before our very eyes. A door.
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m01_002: <TLP>We immediately took note of the odd writings on its surface. It was\nclear that the etchings were of some ancient language, but with the\ncave's darkness and the door's deterioration, it was impossible to\ndecipher its meaning.
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m02_001: <TLP>Investigation Log: Febrai 23, 1449\nAfter our many attempts to open the door, a strange sound began\nechoing all around us. That's when THEY showed up. We were\nswarmed by figures wreathed in lightning.
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m02_002: <TLP>They were strong, far stronger than us. And before I knew it, my\ncompanions had been cut down one after another. I was going to be\nnext. I was terrified, so I abandoned them. I ran. But now I'm lost, and\nI can't remember which way I came from... I'm not making it out\nof here, am I?
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m03_001: <TLP>Investigation Log: Febrai 25, 1449\nIt's been days since I've eaten, and it seems I've hit yet another dead\nend. From beyond the darkness, I see their glow and hear their\nominous footsteps. Those lightning things are coming for me.
MID_LGV_SQID_ResearchTeam_m03_002: <TLP>My time here is almost over. But I should at least have enough oil in\nthis lamp to write my final words. Farewell. We should have never\ntried to open that cursed door. If you're reading this, do not search for\nmy body. LEAVE. If you don't, I fear...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01_001: Please help me. Nobody believes me!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01_002: I've been trapped inside a painting in Aurora's\ntemple for years... For decades!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01_003: When I got out, I found out my parents are\nboth dead...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01_004: and our house was bought by some rich person I've\nnever met before!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01_005: I complained to the temples, but all they did was ask\nif I could prove it was my house!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01_006: I didn't know how I could do that, but I remembered\nI lost the key to the house when I was playing...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01_007: It's got a winged lion engraved on it. Only my parents\nwould have known it's the key to the house.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01_008: If I could find that key, it'd open the door and prove\nI'm telling the truth, right? Can you help me find it?
MID_LGA_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m01: <BLN>Nobody believes me!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m02_001: That's it! That's the key! Look at the winged lion!\nThe key to my house!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m02_002: You found it where?! Maybe since it's so pretty they\nthought they could sell it as a decoration?
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m02_003: My dad was so mad with me when I lost this key...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m02_004: I wonder if he'd be happy now that it's found and I\ncan use it to get the house back?
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m02_005: I don't care what he'd think. Not really. I'd just be so\nhappy to see him and Mom again... It's all I want.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m02_006: *sniffle* Thank you so much for helping me. I can\nfinally go home.
MID_LGA_SQID_SmallCastle1_B01_m02: <BLN>I can finally go home...
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m01_001: I'm researching one of the legendary Flame Lords of\nDagda. The Unsinkable Gisco!
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m01_002: He was a soldier who earned many accolades in the\nbattles between our country and Brigid.
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m01_003: Legends say he hid treasures all across the Dagdan\ncontinent before he died.
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m01_004: He even left behind a coded riddle for each of their\nhiding places. Here, listen to this one...
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m01_005: "A colossus gazes upon Baal's waters. On the stone\nwhere she points, something worthy of note."
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m01_006: Ha! Think you can solve it? If you find the treasure,\nplease let me have a look!
MID_LGA_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m01: <BLN>I don't get it at all...
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m02_001: Wha?! You actually solved Gisco's riddle?
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m02_002: I see... And here I couldn't solve any of his\ncodes myself...
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m02_003: But I'M the one who even told you about the riddle,\nso I'll be keeping the treasure! Mehehe!
MID_LGV_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m02_004: Don't worry, I'm sure you'll still be a better\nadventurer than me without it. Thank you.
MID_LGA_SQID_GiscoTreasure_B01_m02: <BLN>I didn't really think you'd solve it...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m01_001: Nobody believes me when I tell them I was trapped\ninside of a painting.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m01_002: Other than that, ever since I've been able to go home,\nthings have been fine.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m01_003: But it's kind of making me sad too. A little more\nevery day...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m01_004: I mean... Mom, Dad, all of my friends... They're all\ngone, but I'm still here.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m01_005: I'm starting to think maybe I should sell the house\nand start a life somewhere brand new.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m01_006: But I don't want somebody weird living there!\nIt's important it goes to someone nice.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m01_007: If you meet anybody you think might be a good fit,\nplease let me know!
MID_LGA_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m01: <BLN>Maybe somebody nice would...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m02_001: There's someone looking to buy a house like mine?\nAnd they seem nice? Hmmm...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m02_002: If they do open a restaurant, then I'd be able to visit\nthe house any time I miss it...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m02_003: You know what? I'm going to GIVE them the house.\nFree of charge!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m02_004: Aurora's temple paid me for the time I spent trapped\nthere, so I don't need the money from the house.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m02_005: I'm going to go talk to the new homeowner!\nThank you for everything! Take care!
MID_LGA_SQID_SmallCastle2_B01_m02: <BLN>Take care!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B02_m01_001: I'm looking to buy a house, but I'd like the opinion\nof someone local.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B02_m01_002: I'm planning to open a restaurant in the capital to\nserve all my favorites from my homeland!
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B02_m01_003: I want a place that's bright and calming, where\nmy patrons can relax and enjoy themselves.
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B02_m01_004: But everything I've seen is either far too expensive,\ntoo small, or too far out of the way...
MID_LGV_SQID_SmallCastle2_B02_m01_005: Please tell me if you discover any property that\nwould match what I'm looking for.
MID_LGA_SQID_SmallCastle2_B02_m01: <BLN>I'm looking to buy a house...
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m01_001: Hi, I'm Kinkara. I'm a long-time researcher of the\nancient civilization of Iskandariya.
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m01_002: When the empire destroyed Iskandariya, they also\ntorched all its history, making research challenging.
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m01_003: But I recently recovered an ancient tablet that could\nlead to untold knowledge about Iskandariyan history!
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m01_004: Only, as soon as I secured it, my laboratory was\nransacked and the tablet was stolen...
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m01_005: This is a huge loss for humanity if we do nothing.\nWe have to get it back at all costs!
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m01_006: Luckily, I coated the tablet with a special fragrance,\nso I have a general idea of its location.
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m01_007: When you find the Iskandariyan {Lowercase}Ancient Tablet{NormalCase}, \nplease bring it to me immediately!
MID_LGA_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m01: <BLN>Who could have taken it?
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m02_001: You actually found it! Oh, I'm so grateful!
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m02_002: I did some digging and I know who stole it. It was\nthe Order of Mithras. Have you heard of them?
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m02_003: They lurk in the shadows of the empire, plotting,\nscheming, and taking!
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m02_004: If they've got their eyes on me, staying in Dagsion\nmight not be safe anymore.
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m02_005: At least if I leave, they won't be able to interfere\nwith my research anymore...
MID_LGV_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m02_006: I'll collect my research and leave when I can. Thank\nyou for everything... I hope we meet again someday.
MID_LGA_SQID_AcademicFreedom_B01_m02: <BLN>Until we meet again!
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m01_001: To perceive me here, even as I attempt to erase my\npresence... You're a capable one, aren't you?
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m01_002: Hm... And along with your skills, I presume you\ncarry a discreet tongue. If that is so...
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m01_003: Perhaps I can entrust you with a task of some\ngravity. There is a letter in another country.
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m01_004: Its previous courier was killed. But he was wise\nenough to hide it someplace before his end.
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m01_005: I can't leave this place for...reasons. But you. Find the\nletter and bring it here to me.
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m01_006: And one more thing, traveler... You'd do well to\nnever open the letter. Good luck...
MID_LGA_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m01: <BLN>...
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m02_001: The letter. You've delivered it just as I asked.\nIt seems I was wise to put my faith in you.
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m02_002: This letter has a special mechanism that reveals\nif the seal has been broken.
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m02_003: And look. Not broken. Proof that you followed my\ninstructions.
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m02_004: As expected, you did a perfect job.
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m02_005: You see, trust is easy to lose but hard to gain.
MID_LGV_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m02_006: Know that you've gained mine in abundance. Well\ndone. If I have need of you again, I'll seek you out.
MID_LGA_SQID_MessengerRequest_B01_m02: <BLN>I trust you, traveler.
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m01_001: Oh, hey, I know you! I've heard all about your\nfeats in the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m01_002: I am Daniel, a captain in the Dagdan Imperial Army.
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m01_003: I shouldn't be saying this out loud, but... I'm currently\npursuing a...certain group.
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m01_004: This secret group hides in the empire and exchanges\ninformation with other countries.
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m01_005: If someone ever asks you to deliver something\nsuspicious, it'd be best if you just brought it to me.
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m01_006: Please... For the safety of the empire!
MID_LGA_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m01: <BLN>Where are they hiding?
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m02_001: Huh?! A secret letter? You did the right thing\nbringing this to me. Thank you for your service!
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m02_002: Hm. At first glance it seems like any old private\nletter, but it's probably an encrypted message!
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m02_003: If we can decipher it, we might be able to get a \nlead on what this group truly is.
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m02_004: To think, you contacted and outwitted suspects we\ncouldn't even trace? Remarkable!
MID_LGV_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m02_005: Thank you for your hard work. If possible, we could\nuse your cooperation again!
MID_LGA_SQID_DisturbingElements_B01_m02: <BLN>You'd be an asset.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m01_001: Right on time. I have a task that absolutely must be\ncarried out.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m01_002: I need someone who will complete it without failure.\nYes, someone like you.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m01_003: It's very simple. You must seek out and kill a man\nnamed Inno.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m01_004: Why, you ask? Because you'll get a reward,\nthat's why.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m01_005: I can explain to you the reason behind it—but not\nuntil you've done the job.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m01_006: You're welcome to back out, of course. But we both\nknow that you won't.
MID_LGA_SQID_Assassination_B01_m01: <BLN>...
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B02_m01_001: How could they have killed Sir Inno of all people? No...
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B02_m01_002: I am sorry Aswan... I could not...be of assistance...
MID_LGA_SQID_Assassination_B02_m01: <BLN>Wh-what...
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02_001: Bravo. I knew you'd come through.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02_002: The reason for the murder? Ah, yes. I suppose I did\npromise an explanation.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02_003: King Gilchris is the current—rightful—ruler of\nArago.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02_004: But some don't approve of his reign. Royalists still\nloyal to the previous king.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02_005: Inno was something of a leader among them,\nwielding considerable influence.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02_006: If the "wise" Queen Aswan were to heed his\nnonsense, division would no doubt follow.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02_007: You've saved Arago from that fate.
MID_LGV_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02_008: Be proud! You're a hero. Albeit an unsung one.
MID_LGA_SQID_Assassination_B01_m02: <BLN>Now you know.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01_001: I am Daniel, a captain in the Dagdan Imperial Army.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01_002: It seems we meet at just the right time. There's\nsomething I'd like to ask you...
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01_003: Have you ever heard of flamma? Perhaps you've\nseen it? It's a strange amber liquid.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01_004: Those who drink it trade temporary strength for the\nrisk of becoming a ruined shell. It is forbidden.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01_005: Recently it's been smuggled into the capital, and its\nusers seem to be on the rise!
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01_006: Luckily, I found a lead on the source. A group hiding\nin Merak Pass.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01_007: I've requested a squad to take them down, but the\nhigher-ups are refusing to respond...
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01_008: If we keep stalling, the damage will only spread!\nWill you help me put a stop to them?
MID_LGA_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m01: <BLN>Why won't they respond?
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m02_001: Thank you! This will put an end to all the damage\nthey've caused.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m02_002: The group you encountered did indeed have flamma\nin their possession...
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m02_003: And it seems they had plans to spread their villainy\nto Grand Aragon, the royal capital of Arago.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m02_004: Some of them may have escaped, but we'll catch\nthem at our checkpoints, to be sure.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m02_005: I may be reprimanded for acting out on my own, but\nonce the flamma is gone, it'll be fine.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m02_006: I'll expose their true identities! You can hold me to it.
MID_LGA_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B01_m02: <BLN>I'll expose them!
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B02_m01_001: I hear Captain Daniel has suddenly been relegated\nto viceroy of Minae county.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B02_m01_002: Apparently they're in a hurry to be rid of him.\nHe's being shipped out of Dagsion tomorrow...
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B02_m01_003: He was a man of justice—of conviction! He must\nhave gotten mixed up with some dangerous people.
MID_LGV_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B02_m01_004: They're calling it a textbook demotion. But who\nknows what's true anymore...
MID_LGA_SQID_FulamaSmuggler_B02_m01: <BLN>Daniel...
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m01_001: I'm worried about something and need someone to\ntalk to about it. Do you have a moment?
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m01_002: The Divine Sovereign occasionally slips out of the \ntemple without anyone noticing.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m01_003: It makes me sad that he doesn't trust me to share\nwhere he goes. I've served him for over 30 years.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m01_004: I used to think he was visiting a lady friend, but now\nI don't believe that's the case.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m01_005: Still, I have no other ideas... Could you find out?\nSomeone in hightown must have seen him.
MID_LGA_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m01: <BLN>I've served him for so long...
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B02_m01_001: Yeah, I've seen the Divine Sovereign around. He\nkeeps his hood up because he thinks it hides him.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B02_m01_002: Hehe. You can still spot him right away. He's got a\nunique presence, you know?
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B02_m01_003: I tried tailing him once. I was sure he was having\na secret rendezvous. 
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B02_m01_004: But I lost sight of him after he got near the state\nguesthouses.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B02_m01_005: I wonder if that is where he was going? What's there,\ndo you figure? It smells like a big old secret to me.
MID_LGA_SQID_PopeSecret_B02_m01: <BLN>Just another day...
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B03_m01_001: I thought... Was that... Maybe. Yeah, I'm pretty sure\nit was Solel. Is that possible?
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B03_m01_002: I've seen him a few times now. Alone, and not going\ninto the Crystal Palace, so I've been curious.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B03_m01_003: I thought he might be heading to the {LowercaseNextLetter}Thermae, trying\nto mix in with the plebs or something.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B03_m01_004: But when I went looking for him, he wasn't there.\nI just ended up getting overheated for nothing.
MID_LGA_SQID_PopeSecret_B03_m01: <BLN>I'm pretty sure it was...
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B04_m01_001: The Divine Sovereign? In disguise? I've never seen\nhim here, but...
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B04_m01_002: I'll share a rumor with you. Have you heard of the\nsecret garden of Dagsion?
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B04_m01_003: The story goes that somewhere in Dagsion, there's a\nplace where {LowercaseNextLetter}Linaria flowers bloom.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B04_m01_004: And in one corner of the garden is an old tomb,\nwhere offerings of the flowers are left.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B04_m01_005: No idea if that's true or not. I heard it a long time\nago, from a friend who got lost while he was drunk.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B04_m01_006: Still, though, maybe it's a special place for someone?\nInteresting to think about, huh?
MID_LGA_SQID_PopeSecret_B04_m01: <BLN>I'll share a rumor with you...
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m02_001: You didn't find out the exact location of his trips?\nWell, that's no good, is it?
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m02_002: I've decided that whatever the Divine Sovereign\ngets up to is his business alone.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m02_003: He doesn't owe me his secrets. I shouldn't have\nstarted snooping around behind his back.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m02_004: Still, I am relieved that you looked into things for me.
MID_LGV_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m02_005: Please consider the request complete. And, please,\nkeep it a secret between us?
MID_LGA_SQID_PopeSecret_B01_m02: <BLN>I am relieved...